te(key); const idx=agent.reservedSeats.indexOf(key); if(idx>=0) agent.reservedSeats.splice(idx,1);}\\nfunction releaseAgentSeats(agent){ agent.reservedSeats.slice().forEach(function(key){seatReservations.delete(key)}); agent.reservedSeats=[];}\\n```\\n\\nAction seatKey stored in RELEASE_SEAT action for explicit. For meeting plan set release action `{type:'RELEASE_SEAT', seatKey:key}`. For lounge etc.\\n\\nNeed SIT action maybe seatKey? not necessary.\\n\\n`findFreeSeat` reserves at compile. If plan later aborted, releaseAgentSeats.\\n\\nPotential issue workers planAttendMeeting fallback planVisitLounge calls reserve seat. fine.\\n\\n`planWorkAtDesk`:\\n```\\nfunction planWorkAtDesk(agent){\\n if(agent.floor===agent.homeFloor && agent.state==='AT_DESK') return [{WAIT_SIM minutes},PICK];\\n const actions=[];\\n if(agent.floor!==agent.homeFloor){ actions.push({WALK_TO_WP floor elevWait}); appendTravel(...); }\\n actions.push({WALK deskDoor},{WALK desk},{ENTER_STATE AT_DESK},{SIT desk},{WAIT_SIM},{PICK});\\n return actions;\\n}\\n```\\nBut if at desk sitting, WAIT. If at desk but standing maybe still. Fine.\\nNeed if agent in meeting and choose? no.\\n\\n`planVisitCoworker` fallback planWorkAtDesk maybe if no candidate.\\n\\n`planReturnToDesk` not separate.\\n\\nNow chooseNextActivity meeting times: `plannedMeetingTimes` sorted. Use findIndex. If now >= time and now-time<120. If meeting time much earlier due high timescale, still attend if within 120 sim minutes. Else drop? We can drop if <now-180. Use loop remove old. Simpler:\\n```\\nfor i=0;i<times.length;i++ if now>=times[i] && now-times[i]<120 { splice; plan; return; }\\n```\\nOld meetings remain forever; maybe remove if now-times[i]>=120. Add filter.\\n\\nDeparture override before choose. Also if lunch time passed and not lunched maybe at desk. Good.\\n\\n`maybeDepart`: Need not override visitors. For workers. Condition simMinute>=departureTime. If agent.state==='IN_CAR' etc skip. If currentAction type elevator busy skip. If already leaving skip. Release seats then planLeave. But if currently SIT at desk, currentAction is WAIT_SIM (since SIT zero done). Override plan with STAND first. Good.\\nIf state AT_LUNCH and sitting at bistro, planLeaveBuilding from floor0: STAND, release, WALK elevWait (but floor0), appendTravel none, WALK lobby_center... okay.\\nIf state IN_MEETING sitting, planLeave from meeting floor. Good.\\nSet agent.leaving=true.\\n\\n`planLeaveBuilding` uses agent.floor. For worker on floor home etc. If agent floor0 and at bistro, actions [STAND, RELEASE, WALK lobby_center, entrance...]. If floor0, don't WALK elevWait. We'll:\\n```\\nif(agent.floor!==0) { WALK elevWait; appendTravel(floor,0); }\\nactions WALK lobby_center, entrance, threshold, outside, EXIT\\n```\\nIf floor0 but at back lounge, WALK lobby_center BFS. good.\\nIf floor>0 and sitting at desk, WALK elevWait direct from desk. good.\\n\\n`planGoToLunch` uses agent.floor maybe floor0? Workers usually upper. If floor0 (already at lobby), skip travel. appendTravel handles same. But we push WALK elevWait only if floor!==0? If floor0 at desk? no. We'll still WALK elevWait maybe unnecessary. Better:\\n```\\nif(agent.floor!==0){ actions.push(WALK elevWait); appendTravel(actions,agent.floor,0);}\\n```\\nThen bistro.\\nReturn to desk:\\n```\\nif(homeFloor!==0) { WALK elevWait; appendTravel(actions,0,homeFloor);}\\n```\\nWorkers home floor 1..5.\\n\\n`planAttendMeeting` target floor maybe home. From agent.floor:\\n```\\nactions=[STAND,RELEASE, {WALK_TO_WP floor elevWait}]\\nappendTravel(actions, agent.floor, targetFloor)\\nactions WALK conf_center, WALK seat, ENTER_STATE IN_MEETING, SIT, WAIT...\\n```\\nIf agent.floor===targetFloor, WALK elevWait unnecessary; BFS from desk to conf center could direct. We can only add WALK elevWait if different floor? For travel same floor, not needed. So:\\n```\\nif(agent.floor!==targetFloor) actions.push WALK elevWait;\\nappendTravel...\\nactions WALK conf_center (BFS from current position; if same floor from desk, direct path)...\\n```\\nBut if agent.floor===targetFloor and we don't walk elevWait, WALK conf_center BFS from desk works. If different, after EXIT at target floor elevWait, WALK conf_center works. Good.\\nReturn: WALK elevWait, appendTravel(target,home), WALK desk...\\nEven same floor, WALK elevWait unnecessary; but if target==home, after meeting on same floor, just WALK desk. We can conditionally:\\n```\\nif(targetFloor!==agent.homeFloor){ WALK elevWait; appendTravel(target,home);}\\nWALK desk...\\n```\\nIf target differs, appendTravel includes WALK elevWait from target; so don't separately? appendTravel first action is WALK elevWait. So just call appendTravel if different. Similarly for lunch. Let's define appendTravel always starts with WALK_TO_WP(fromFloor,'elevWait'). Then callers should not duplicate. Good.\\n\\nSo appendTravel actions:\\n```\\nif from===to return;\\nactions.push(WALK_TO_WP from elevWait);\\nactions.push(WAIT_AT_PANEL from dir to);\\n...\\n```\\nFor planGoToLunch from floor>0 call appendTravel directly (no WALK elevWait separately). For floor0 no travel.\\nFor planAttendMeeting from floor to target call appendTravel; then after travel WALK conf. But if same floor no travel and WALK conf direct. Good.\\nFor planVisitCoworker similarly.\\nFor arrival plan: we already walk lobby_center then can push WALK elevWait, WAIT... Since fromFloor0 to home. Could call appendTravel after lobby_center; it will push WALK elevWait. Good. We'll use explicit for clarity.\\n\\n`appendTravel` includes EXIT_ELEVATOR which sets floor. Good.\\n\\nNow planArrive:\\n```\\nconst actions=[\\n WALK outside, threshold, entrance, lobby_center\\n];\\nappendTravel(actions,0,home);\\nactions.push(WALK deskDoor, WALK desk, ENTER_STATE AT_DESK, SIT desk, WAIT_SIM..., PICK)\\n```\\nappendTravel adds WALK elevWait. Good.\\n\\nplanVisitorVisit start after lobby_center. For lobby activities no travel. For floor activity appendTravel(actions,0,floor) from lobby_center (will walk elevWait). Then activity. Then appendTravel(actions,floor,0). Then exit.\\n\\nExit chain after lobby_center:\\n```\\nactions.push WALK lobby_center, WALK entrance, WALK threshold, WALK outside, EXIT_BUILDING\\n```\\nIf activity on floor0 and currently at bistro, WALK lobby_center BFS. Good.\\n\\nFor office lounge activity choose floor and seat before appending. If no seat, choose water_cooler stand. We need activity actions generated after travel. Let's structure:\\n```\\nlet floor=0;\\nlet actions=[WALK outside, threshold, entrance, lobby_center];\\nconst roll...\\nif activity uses upper floor:\\n  floor=randInt(1,5)\\n  const seat=findFreeSeat...\\n  appendTravel(actions,0,floor)\\n  if seat: WALK seat, ENTER_STATE VISITING, SIT seat, WAIT, STAND, RELEASE\\n  else WALK water_cooler, ENTER_STATE VISITING, WAIT\\n  appendTravel(actions,floor,0)\\nelse lobby activity...\\nexit chain\\n```\\nFor meeting, target seat, state IN_MEETING.\\nFor back lounge etc.\\n\\nNeed if floor upper and meeting seat unavailable fallback: choose loiter floor0 no travel. We can decide before travel: if no seat, set activity loiter. Implement.\\n\\nRoll weights:\\n```\\nconst r=Math.random();\\nif(r<0.10) bistro\\nelse if(r<0.16) counter\\nelse if(r<0.30) front lounge\\nelse if(r<0.42) back/pit\\nelse if(r<0.52) stand\\nelse if(r<0.62) loiter\\nelse if(r<0.77) office lounge\\nelse meeting\\n```\\nGood.\\n\\nVisitor lunch? no.\\n\\nNow SIT orientation and y offset. For seated floor0/upper. Good.\\n\\n`stand` after sitting sets y floor*FH. When SIT at car? no.\\n\\nAction dispatch loop:\\n```\\nfunction dispatchActions(agent, dt) {\\n let guard=0;\\n while(guard<16){\\n   guard++;\\n   if(!agent.currentAction){\\n     if(agent.plan && agent.plan.length){ agent.currentAction=agent.plan.shift(); agent._started=false; }\\n     else { chooseNextActivity(agent); if(!agent.plan||!agent.plan.length) break; continue; }\\n   }\\n   const done=processAction(agent, agent.currentAction, dt);\\n   if(done){ agent.currentAction=null; } else break;\\n }\\n}\\n```\\nWhen plan empty after EXIT_BUILDING, chooseNextActivity would be called, but state GONE so dispatch not called because updateAgents skip GONE. Good. After visitor plan EXIT, currentAction completes, loop currentAction null, plan empty, chooseNextActivity would run in same dispatch! Because state GONE set by EXIT_BUILDING but loop doesn't check. Need in loop after done check agent.state GONE/DISABLED -> break. Add:\\n```\\nif(agent.state==='GONE'||agent.state==='DISABLED') break;\\n```\\nAlso chooseNextActivity for visitor if plan empty but not gone could choose worker logic; avoid. We can in chooseNextActivity if role visitor and not leaving -> planVisitorVisit? But visitor should always have plan. Fine.\\n\\n`processAction` start:\\n```\\nif(!action._started){ startAction(agent,action); action._started=true; }\\nswitch...\\n```\\nFor zero-duration, startAction may set things then return true.\\n\\nWAIT_SIM: startAction sets `action.untilMin = simClock.simMinute + action.minutes;` Important if action.minutes undefined use 0. Then in process check. If already started and simMinute>=untilMin return true. At 600x simMinute increments before agent processing in same frame. Fine.\\n\\n`WAIT_AT_PANEL` start presses. Process checks. Re-press every frame if missing:\\n```\\nif(dir>0) elevator.callUp(floor); else elevator.callDown(floor);\\n```\\nBut if car is accepting and capacity free, we complete before re-press. Good.\\nNeed if agent.floor changed? floor action. Use action.floor.\\n\\n`ENTER_ELEVATOR` start: if action.spot missing. Need if agent not at action.floor? no.\\nWhen reserve, spot local. For door walk target world x=spot.x, z=1.45, y=agent.floor*FH. But if elevator car at current floor and doors open, car z front door at1.1. threshold z=1.45. Agent walking from elevWait z3.9 to z1.45. Good.\\nStall detection:\\n```\\nif(action.phase==='door'){\\n  const prev=action._prevPos||pos.clone();\\n  const moved=pos.distanceTo(prev);\\n  action._stallT=(action._stallT||0)+dt;\\n  if(moved<0.005){ if(action._stallT>1.5){ pos.set(targetX, y, targetZ); action.phase='inside'; action._stallT=0; } } else action._stallT=0;\\n  action._prevPos=pos.clone();\\n}\\n```\\nBut if we teleport phase inside then still need attach in same process. We can set phase and fall through? Code sequential ifs. We'll structure with `if phase door { ... if reached set phase inside else return false }` then `if phase inside...`. If stall teleports set phase inside and continue. Good.\\n\\nWhen phase inside: carGroup.attach. Note if agent.group.parent maybe scene. attach works. Set phase spot. Maybe car local spot. Need if car moves? no.\\nSpot movement: use local position. `agent.group.position` local after attach. Move x/z. Set y=0. On reach completeBoard. Also rotation.y=0 (face +Z doors). Return true.\\nBut if completeBoard fails due capacity? We reserved so should. If fails, maybe release? return false. We'll call completeBoard; if true return true else wait.\\n\\n`EXIT_ELEVATOR` start:\\n```\\nelevator.registerDisembark(agent);\\nscene.attach(agent.group);\\nagent.floor=action.toFloor;\\nagent.group.position.y=agent.floor*FH;\\naction._exitTarget = world.floors[action.toFloor].nodes.elevWait.pos.clone();\\naction._prevPos=...\\n```\\nIf group parent not car (maybe already scene), scene.attach okay.\\nProcess move toward target; if dist<=0.25 or step>=dist -> pos set target; completeDisembark; return true. Use dt. Stall recovery teleport.\\nSet state ON_FLOOR.\\nNeed maybe agent group local? after attach world coords. Good.\\nCompleteDisembark releases spot.\\n\\n`PRESS_FLOOR`: elevator.pressDestination(action.floor); agent.state='IN_CAR'; return true.\\n`WAIT_FOR_FLOOR`: agent.state='IN_CAR'; if elevator.state==='DOOR_OPEN' && currentFloor===action.floor return true; else false.\\nPotential if elevator currentFloor floor but state opening not open yet; wait.\\nAt high dt car might skip? logic arrival sets OPENING; next frame OPEN. okay.\\n\\n`SIT` start with floor data. If target sit, group y floorY-0.35. But person origin feet at 0 and hips .9; chair seat height .46. Lowering .35 gives hips .55, close. Good.\\nFor standing jitter, y floorY.\\nSet agent.state maybe already set by ENTER_STATE. For visitor desk? no.\\n\\n`STAND` start maybe if agent parent car? y=0. if scene y=floor*FH.\\n`RELEASE_SEAT`: release key or all. return true.\\n`EXIT_BUILDING`: remove. Also if agent.group.parent===elevator.carGroup? scene.attach? just remove from parent. release seats. state GONE. visible false. leaving=false. Maybe agent.floor=0. return true.\\n`ENTER_STATE`: set.\\n`MARK_LUNCHED`: set.\\n`PICK_NEXT_ACTIVITY`: chooseNextActivity; return true.\\n`WALK_TO_WP`: start builds path; process walk. Need if path empty return true? if no path, teleport maybe. We'll set path to target node if exists. If still empty return true.\\n\\nPath building nearest node may choose node on wrong floor? nodes per floor. fine.\\n\\n`walkAlongPath` should use agent.floor for y. But if path node positions have y floor*FH. We'll set pos.y = agent.floor*FH each step.\\n\\nStall detection with dt: At low speed dt .016, moved ~.02 > .005, so no stall. If blocked, moved maybe collision pushes <.005. after 1.2 sec skip. Good. At high dt, moved huge. Good.\\n\\nBut collision pushes agent, walk movement also. Fine.\\n\\n`isEntranceChain` includes outside threshold entrance lobby_center.\\n\\n`applyCollisions` skip if agent.group.parent===elevator.carGroup. Since car parent comparison. We can check `if (a.group.parent === elevator.carGroup) continue` inside loop. If both in car skip.\\n\\nPotential performance of updateLighting every frame with Color lerp new? Use temp colors global? We can create inside but 300 frames fine. Use `const colorA = new THREE.Color(...)` each frame maybe okay. Better keyframes store hex and use temp. Simplicity.\\n\\nHUD stats counts per state. Build object. Use states array. Update text only maybe each frame okay. Could throttle but fine.\\n\\nNeed `window.__sim...` not necessary. But runtime boost sets sliders; maybe it can't find if sliders not range? we create range.\\n\\nRuntime dynamic changes: agents moving and clock changes. At load time 7:30, agents arrive 8:15 so for first 1.2 sec at 120x advances 2.4 sim min to 7:32, no agents. But elevator maybe idle, lighting changes slowly, canvas may change due lighting? At 120x, sim time advances 144 sec? Wait real 1.2s *120 =144 sim seconds =2.4 min. Lighting at 7:30 flat same keyframes 7-12, no change. Canvas checksum might be identical! Then runtime after boost sets speed 600 and occupancy 100, waits 4.2s -> sim advances 42 min from 7:32 to 8:14, agents start arriving around 8:15 maybe at very end. Lighting flat. But dynamic_changes counts object position changes from patched updateMatrixWorld. If no agents move and elevator static, dynamic_changes=0 => no-motion. Need ensure motion within probe. We should spawn some early visitors/agents at start (7:30) or make elevator move? Prompt expected people starting around 8:30, but runtime check 5.5s at 600x gets to ~8:15. Could still be no motion until near end, maybe dynamic changes >0 if last frames agents spawn around 8:14. But risk.\\n\\nTo guarantee dynamic changes, perhaps initial schedule visitors arrival 7:35..9:00? But expected around 8:30. Could add a few \\\"early bird\\\" workers arrival 7:35..8:00. Real office has early arrivals. Or start clock 7:30 but set some workers arrival 7:35. Requirement worker arrival 8:15..9:30 though. Hmm. Runtime boost sets occupancy max and speed max, but only 5.5 sec. At 600x, 5.5s*600=3300 sim sec=55 min, from 7:30 to 8:25. So agents with arrival 8:15 will spawn in last 10 min = 0.6 real sec. Enough for dynamic changes likely. Also topUpVisitors only after 8:00. At 8:00 it re-arms visitors, arrival now+0..6, so they spawn ~8:00-8:06; that's ~0.6s before end? Actually from 7:30 to 8:00 is 30 sim min = 3 real sec; then 2.5 sec real -> 25 sim min, visitors spawn and move. So dynamic changes definitely. Good. But note first canvas snapshot at 1.2s after load (7:32), second at 5.5s (8:25), changed due agents. Fine.\\n\\nHowever topUpVisitors business hours check minute<480. At 600x, after boost at ~1.5s sim 7:45; topup no until 8:00 at ~3s. Then visitors spawn. Great.\\n\\nAt default 120x, topup begins at 8:00 after 15 real sec. Fine.\\n\\nBut runtime boost sets occupancy slider max to 100, which may set targetOccupancy 100, topup rearm 80 visitors. They spawn over 6 min. Performance okay.\\n\\nPotential no-motion if topup not working due visitors state AWAY and arrivalTime > now+15 condition. Initial visitor arrival randInt(480,600), now 8:00=480. For visitor arrivalTime maybe 540 >495 -> rearm. Many. Good.\\n\\nNeed `countPresent` maybe includes ARRIVING etc. topup deficit = 100 - count. Workers arriving around 8:15; before that deficit 100. It will rearm visitors. Good.\\n\\nAt 600x maybe sim day ends after 2.4 min, not within check. Fine.\\n\\nNow, day/night update at 8:25 still day. Canvas changes due agents.\\n\\nLet's write sim.js. Careful about top-level consts unique and not duplicate world's `WORLD`. We'll use SIM_ prefix.\\n\\nOne more: `window.addEventListener` callback param event? not needed.\\n\\nLet's write.\",\"format\":\"unknown\",\"index\":0}]"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"chatcmpl-tool-8d374b0e478ca42e","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/jeff/Code/llm-eval/evals/pi_openrouter_deepseek_deepseek-v4_1-flash-1017_office_prompt_v3/sim.js","content":"/* sim.js - simulated clock, office workers, visitors, lighting and render loop. */\n(function () {\n    \"use strict\";\n\n    const SIM_MAX_WORKERS = 20;\n    const SIM_MAX_VISITORS = 80;\n    const SIM_MAX_OCCUPANCY = SIM_MAX_WORKERS + SIM_MAX_VISITORS;\n    const SIM_DEFAULT_OCCUPANCY = 45;\n    const AGENT_WALK_SPEED = 1.35;\n    const AGENT_SEPARATION = 0.78;\n    const ENTRANCE_WAYPOINTS = [\"outside\", \"front_door_threshold\", \"entrance\", \"lobby_center\"];\n\n    const FIRST_NAMES = [\n        \"Ava\", \"Ben\", \"Cara\", \"Dev\", \"Elena\", \"Finn\", \"Gina\", \"Hugo\", \"Iris\", \"Jack\",\n        \"Kira\", \"Liam\", \"Maya\", \"Nico\", \"Olive\", \"Pablo\", \"Quinn\", \"Rosa\", \"Sam\", \"Tara\",\n        \"Uma\", \"Vince\", \"Willa\", \"Xander\", \"Yara\", \"Zane\", \"Noah\", \"Mia\", \"Owen\", \"Ruby\"\n    ];\n\n    const DAY_KEYFRAMES = [\n        { hour: 0, bg: 0x111827, sun: 0x8899bb, sunInt: 0.12, amb: 0.45, hemi: 0.32 },\n        { hour: 5.5, bg: 0x111827, sun: 0x8899bb, sunInt: 0.12, amb: 0.45, hemi: 0.32 },\n        { hour: 6.0, bg: 0x2b2b3d, sun: 0xffb066, sunInt: 0.35, amb: 0.48, hemi: 0.35 },\n        { hour: 6.5, bg: 0x8fb7d9, sun: 0xffe0b0, sunInt: 0.8, amb: 0.55, hemi: 0.5 },\n        { hour: 7.0, bg: 0xbfd9ef, sun: 0xfff2cc, sunInt: 1.0, amb: 0.55, hemi: 0.55 },\n        { hour: 12.0, bg: 0xcfe6f7, sun: 0xffffff, sunInt: 1.05, amb: 0.55, hemi: 0.55 },\n        { hour: 17.0, bg: 0xd9c8a8, sun: 0xffd28a, sunInt: 0.9, amb: 0.52, hemi: 0.5 },\n        { hour: 17.5, bg: 0xb97b52, sun: 0xff9a55, sunInt: 0.55, amb: 0.48, hemi: 0.42 },\n        { hour: 18.0, bg: 0x5c4a5e, sun: 0xcc7744, sunInt: 0.3, amb: 0.46, hemi: 0.36 },\n        { hour: 18.5, bg: 0x1b2233, sun: 0x7788aa, sunInt: 0.14, amb: 0.45, hemi: 0.32 },\n        { hour: 24, bg: 0x111827, sun: 0x8899bb, sunInt: 0.12, amb: 0.45, hemi: 0.32 }\n    ];\n\n    let scene = null;\n    let camera = null;\n    let renderer = null;\n    let controls = null;\n    let world = null;\n    let elevator = null;\n    let sunLight = null;\n    let ambientLight = null;\n    let hemiLight = null;\n    let agents = [];\n    let seatReservations = new Set();\n    let targetOccupancy = SIM_DEFAULT_OCCUPANCY;\n    let hudTime = null;\n    let hudStats = null;\n    let hudOccupancy = null;\n    let lastFrameMs = 0;\n\n    const simClock = {\n        simMinute: 7 * 60 + 30,\n        timeScale: 120,\n        onNewDay: null,\n        tick: function (realDt) {\n            this.simMinute += realDt * this.timeScale / 60;\n            if (this.simMinute >= 24 * 60) {\n                this.simMinute -= 24 * 60;\n                if (this.onNewDay) this.onNewDay();\n            }\n        },\n        format: function () {\n            const total = Math.floor(this.simMinute) % (24 * 60);\n            let hour = Math.floor(total / 60);\n            const minute = total % 60;\n            const suffix = hour >= 12 ? \"PM\" : \"AM\";\n            hour = hour % 12;\n            if (hour === 0) hour = 12;\n            return \" \" + hour + \":\" + String(minute).padStart(2, \"0\") + \" \" + suffix;\n        }\n    };\n\n    function randInt(min, max) {\n        return Math.floor(Math.random() * (max - min + 1)) + min;\n    }\n\n    function randomChoice(list) {\n        if (!list || !list.length) return null;\n        return list[Math.floor(Math.random() * list.length)];\n    }\n\n    function seatKey(floor, wpName) {\n        return String(floor) + \":\" + wpName;\n    }\n\n    function reserveSeat(agent, floor, wpName) {\n        const key = seatKey(floor, wpName);\n        if (seatReservations.has(key)) return null;\n        seatReservations.add(key);\n        if (agent.reservedSeats.indexOf(key) === -1) agent.reservedSeats.push(key);\n        return key;\n    }\n\n    function releaseSeatKey(agent, key) {\n        if (!key) return;\n        seatReservations.delete(key);\n        const index = agent.reservedSeats.indexOf(key);\n        if (index >= 0) agent.reservedSeats.splice(index, 1);\n    }\n\n    function releaseAgentSeats(agent) {\n        for (let i = 0; i < agent.reservedSeats.length; i += 1) {\n            seatReservations.delete(agent.reservedSeats[i]);\n        }\n        agent.reservedSeats = [];\n    }\n\n    function findFreeSeat(agent, floor, names) {\n        if (!names || !names.length) return null;\n        const start = Math.floor(Math.random() * names.length);\n        for (let offset = 0; offset < names.length; offset += 1) {\n            const wpName = names[(start + offset) % names.length];\n            const key = reserveSeat(agent, floor, wpName);\n            if (key) return { wp: wpName, key: key };\n        }\n        return null;\n    }\n\n    function resampleSchedule(agent, initial) {\n        releaseAgentSeats(agent);\n        agent.hasLunched = false;\n        agent.leaving = false;\n        agent.plan = [];\n        agent.currentAction = null;\n        agent.path = [];\n        agent.pathIndex = 0;\n        agent.group.userData.isSitting = false;\n        agent.group.userData.isWalking = false;\n        agent.plannedMeetingTimes = [];\n\n        if (agent.role === \"WORKER\") {\n            agent.arrivalTime = randInt(8 * 60 + 15, 9 * 60 + 30);\n            agent.lunchTime = randInt(11 * 60 + 30, 13 * 60 + 30);\n            agent.lunchDuration = randInt(25, 60);\n            agent.departureTime = randInt(16 * 60 + 45, 18 * 60 + 30);\n            if (Math.random() < 0.15) agent.departureTime = randInt(18 * 60 + 30, 19 * 60 + 45);\n            if (Math.random() < 0.65) agent.plannedMeetingTimes.push(randInt(9 * 60 + 30, 11 * 60 + 20));\n            if (Math.random() < 0.6) agent.plannedMeetingTimes.push(randInt(13 * 60 + 30, 16 * 60));\n            agent.plannedMeetingTimes.sort(function (a, b) { return a - b; });\n        } else {\n            if (initial) {\n                agent.arrivalTime = randInt(8 * 60, 10 * 60);\n            } else {\n                agent.arrivalTime = simClock.simMinute + randInt(0, 6);\n            }\n            agent.visitDuration = randInt(30, 100);\n            agent.lunchTime = randInt(11 * 60 + 30, 13 * 60 + 30);\n            agent.lunchDuration = randInt(25, 50);\n            agent.departureTime = agent.arrivalTime + agent.visitDuration;\n        }\n    }\n\n    function buildAgents() {\n        const deskPool = [];\n        for (let floor = 1; floor < WORLD.FLOOR_COUNT; floor += 1) {\n            const desks = world.floors[floor].desks;\n            for (let i = 0; i < desks.length; i += 1) deskPool.push(desks[i]);\n        }\n\n        for (let i = 0; i < SIM_MAX_WORKERS; i += 1) {\n            const desk = deskPool[i % deskPool.length];\n            const group = createPerson();\n            group.visible = false;\n            group.position.set(0, 0, 12);\n            scene.add(group);\n            const agent = {\n                id: i,\n                role: \"WORKER\",\n                name: FIRST_NAMES[i % FIRST_NAMES.length],\n                group: group,\n                state: \"AWAY\",\n                floor: 0,\n                plan: [],\n                currentAction: null,\n                path: [],\n                pathIndex: 0,\n                homeFloor: desk.floor,\n                deskId: desk.id,\n                deskWpName: desk.wp,\n                deskDoorWpName: desk.door,\n                arrivalTime: 0,\n                lunchTime: 0,\n                lunchDuration: 30,\n                departureTime: 0,\n                hasLunched: false,\n                plannedMeetingTimes: [],\n                visitDuration: 0,\n                reservedSeats: [],\n                leaving: false\n            };\n            group.userData.agent = agent;\n            agents.push(agent);\n            resampleSchedule(agent, true);\n        }\n\n        for (let v = 0; v < SIM_MAX_VISITORS; v += 1) {\n            const group = createPerson();\n            group.visible = false;\n            group.position.set(0, 0, 12);\n            scene.add(group);\n            const agent = {\n                id: SIM_MAX_WORKERS + v,\n                role: \"VISITOR\",\n                name: randomChoice(FIRST_NAMES) || \"Guest\",\n                group: group,\n                state: \"AWAY\",\n                floor: 0,\n                plan: [],\n                currentAction: null,\n                path: [],\n                pathIndex: 0,\n                homeFloor: null,\n                deskId: null,\n                deskWpName: null,\n                deskDoorWpName: null,\n                arrivalTime: 0,\n                lunchTime: 0,\n                lunchDuration: 30,\n                departureTime: 0,\n                hasLunched: true,\n                plannedMeetingTimes: [],\n                visitDuration: 60,\n                reservedSeats: [],\n                leaving: false\n            };\n            group.userData.agent = agent;\n            agents.push(agent);\n            resampleSchedule(agent, true);\n        }\n    }\n\n    function applyOccupancy() {\n        for (let i = 0; i < agents.length; i += 1) {\n            const agent = agents[i];\n            const enabled = agent.id < targetOccupancy;\n            if (enabled) {\n                if (agent.state === \"DISABLED\") agent.state = \"AWAY\";\n            } else if (agent.state === \"AWAY\") {\n                agent.state = \"DISABLED\";\n            } else if (agent.state === \"GONE\") {\n                agent.state = \"DISABLED\";\n                agent.group.visible = false;\n                if (agent.group.parent) agent.group.parent.remove(agent.group);\n            }\n        }\n        if (hudOccupancy) {\n            hudOccupancy.textContent = \"Occupancy: \" + targetOccupancy + \" / \" + SIM_MAX_OCCUPANCY + \" people\";\n        }\n    }\n\n    function resetDay() {\n        seatReservations.clear();\n        for (let i = 0; i < agents.length; i += 1) {\n            const agent = agents[i];\n            agent.group.visible = false;\n            if (agent.group.parent) agent.group.parent.remove(agent.group);\n            agent.group.userData.isSitting = false;\n            agent.group.userData.isWalking = false;\n            agent.group.position.set(0, 0, 12);\n            agent.floor = 0;\n            agent.state = agent.id < targetOccupancy ? \"AWAY\" : \"DISABLED\";\n            resampleSchedule(agent, true);\n        }\n        if (elevator) elevator.reset();\n    }\n\n    function countPresent() {\n        let count = 0;\n        for (let i = 0; i < agents.length; i += 1) {\n            const state = agents[i].state;\n            if (state !== \"AWAY\" && state !== \"DISABLED\" && state !== \"GONE\") count += 1;\n        }\n        return count;\n    }\n\n    function topUpVisitors() {\n        const now = simClock.simMinute;\n        if (now < 8 * 60 || now > 18 * 60) return;\n        let deficit = targetOccupancy - countPresent();\n        if (deficit <= 0) return;\n        for (let i = 0; i < agents.length && deficit > 0; i += 1) {\n            const agent = agents[i];\n            if (agent.role !== \"VISITOR\" || agent.id >= targetOccupancy) continue;\n            if (agent.state !== \"GONE\" && agent.state !== \"AWAY\") continue;\n            if (agent.state === \"AWAY\" && agent.arrivalTime <= now + 15) continue;\n            agent.state = \"AWAY\";\n            agent.arrivalTime = now + randInt(0, 6);\n            agent.visitDuration = randInt(30, 100);\n            agent.departureTime = agent.arrivalTime + agent.visitDuration;\n            agent.hasLunched = true;\n            agent.plan = [];\n            agent.currentAction = null;\n            agent.path = [];\n            agent.pathIndex = 0;\n            releaseAgentSeats(agent);\n            agent.group.visible = false;\n            if (agent.group.parent) agent.group.parent.remove(agent.group);\n            deficit -= 1;\n        }\n    }\n\n    function spawnAgent(agent) {\n        if (agent.group.parent && agent.group.parent !== scene) {\n            scene.attach(agent.group);\n        }\n        if (!agent.group.parent) scene.add(agent.group);\n        agent.group.visible = true;\n        agent.group.userData.isSitting = false;\n        agent.group.userData.isWalking = true;\n        agent.group.position.set(\n            (Math.random() - 0.5) * 2.2,\n            0,\n            12 + (Math.random() - 0.5) * 1.5\n        );\n        agent.group.rotation.y = Math.PI;\n        agent.floor = 0;\n        agent.state = \"ARRIVING\";\n        agent.leaving = false;\n        agent.path = [];\n        agent.pathIndex = 0;\n        agent.currentAction = null;\n        releaseAgentSeats(agent);\n        if (agent.role === \"WORKER\") {\n            agent.plan = planArriveToDesk(agent);\n        } else {\n            agent.plan = planVisitorVisit(agent);\n        }\n    }\n\n    function maybeSpawn(agent) {\n        if (agent.state !== \"AWAY\") return;\n        if (agent.id >= targetOccupancy) return;\n        const now = simClock.simMinute;\n        if (now < agent.arrivalTime) return;\n        if (agent.role === \"WORKER\" && now > agent.departureTime) return;\n        if (agent.role === \"VISITOR\" && now > agent.departureTime + 10) return;\n        spawnAgent(agent);\n    }\n\n    function appendTravel(actions, fromFloor, toFloor) {\n        if (fromFloor === toFloor) return;\n        const dir = toFloor > fromFloor ? 1 : -1;\n        actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: fromFloor, wp: \"elevWait\" });\n        actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_AT_PANEL\", floor: fromFloor, dir: dir, toFloor: toFloor });\n        actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_ELEVATOR\", floor: fromFloor, toFloor: toFloor });\n        actions.push({ type: \"PRESS_FLOOR\", floor: toFloor });\n        actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_FOR_FLOOR\", floor: toFloor });\n        actions.push({ type: \"EXIT_ELEVATOR\", floor: toFloor, toFloor: toFloor });\n    }\n\n    function appendExitBuilding(actions) {\n        actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: \"lobby_center\" });\n        actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: \"entrance\" });\n        actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: \"front_door_threshold\" });\n        actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: \"outside\" });\n        actions.push({ type: \"EXIT_BUILDING\" });\n    }\n\n    function planArriveToDesk(agent) {\n        const actions = [\n            { type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: \"outside\" },\n            { type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: \"front_door_threshold\" },\n            { type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: \"entrance\" },\n            { type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: \"lobby_center\" }\n        ];\n        appendTravel(actions, 0, agent.homeFloor);\n        actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: agent.homeFloor, wp: agent.deskDoorWpName });\n        actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: agent.homeFloor, wp: agent.deskWpName });\n        actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"AT_DESK\" });\n        actions.push({ type: \"SIT\", floor: agent.homeFloor, wp: agent.deskWpName });\n        actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(20, 55) });\n        actions.push({ type: \"PICK_NEXT_ACTIVITY\" });\n        return actions;\n    }\n\n    function planLeaveBuilding(agent) {\n        agent.leaving = true;\n        releaseAgentSeats(agent);\n        const floor = agent.floor;\n        const actions = [\n            { type: \"STAND\" },\n            { type: \"RELEASE_SEAT\" }\n        ];\n        if (floor !== 0) appendTravel(actions, floor, 0);\n        appendExitBuilding(actions);\n        return actions;\n    }\n\n    function planGoToLunch(agent) {\n        const actions = [\n            { type: \"STAND\" },\n            { type: \"RELEASE_SEAT\" }\n        ];\n        appendTravel(actions, agent.floor, 0);\n        const floorData = world.floors[0];\n        const seat = findFreeSeat(agent, 0, floorData.cafeSpots);\n        if (seat) {\n            actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: seat.wp });\n            actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"AT_LUNCH\" });\n            actions.push({ type: \"SIT\", floor: 0, wp: seat.wp });\n            actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: agent.lunchDuration });\n            actions.push({ type: \"STAND\" });\n            actions.push({ type: \"RELEASE_SEAT\", seatKey: seat.key });\n        } else {\n            actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: \"cafe_order\" });\n            actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"AT_LUNCH\" });\n            actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: agent.lunchDuration });\n        }\n        actions.push({ type: \"MARK_LUNCHED\" });\n        appendTravel(actions, 0, agent.homeFloor);\n        actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: agent.homeFloor, wp: agent.deskDoorWpName });\n        actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: agent.homeFloor, wp: agent.deskWpName });\n        actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"AT_DESK\" });\n        actions.push({ type: \"SIT\", floor: agent.homeFloor, wp: agent.deskWpName });\n        actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(20, 45) });\n        actions.push({ type: \"PICK_NEXT_ACTIVITY\" });\n        return actions;\n    }\n\n    function planVisitLounge(agent) {\n        const floor = agent.floor;\n        const floorData = world.floors[floor];\n        const seat = findFreeSeat(agent, floor, floorData.loungeSpots);\n        const actions = [\n            { type: \"STAND\" },\n            { type: \"RELEASE_SEAT\" }\n        ];\n        if (seat) {\n            actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: floor, wp: seat.wp });\n            actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"AT_BREAK\" });\n            actions.push({ type: \"SIT\", floor: floor, wp: seat.wp });\n            actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(5, 12) });\n            actions.push({ type: \"STAND\" });\n            actions.push({ type: \"RELEASE_SEAT\", seatKey: seat.key });\n        } else {\n            actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: floor, wp: \"water_cooler\" });\n            actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"AT_BREAK\" });\n            actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(5, 12) });\n        }\n        actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: floor, wp: agent.deskDoorWpName });\n        actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: floor, wp: agent.deskWpName });\n        actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"AT_DESK\" });\n        actions.push({ type: \"SIT\", floor: floor, wp: agent.deskWpName });\n        actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(15, 40) });\n        actions.push({ type: \"PICK_NEXT_ACTIVITY\" });\n        return actions;\n    }\n\n    function planAttendMeeting(agent) {\n        let targetFloor = agent.homeFloor;\n        if (Math.random() >= 0.65) targetFloor = randInt(1, WORLD.FLOOR_COUNT - 1);\n        const floorData = world.floors[targetFloor];\n        const seat = findFreeSeat(agent, targetFloor, floorData.confSeats);\n        if (!seat) return planVisitLounge(agent);\n\n        const actions = [\n            { type: \"STAND\" },\n            { type: \"RELEASE_SEAT\" }\n        ];\n        appendTravel(actions, agent.floor, targetFloor);\n        actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: targetFloor, wp: \"conf_center\" });\n        actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: targetFloor, wp: seat.wp });\n        actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"IN_MEETING\" });\n        actions.push({ type: \"SIT\", floor: targetFloor, wp: seat.wp });\n        actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(22, 45) });\n        actions.push({ type: \"STAND\" });\n        actions.push({ type: \"RELEASE_SEAT\", seatKey: seat.key });\n        appendTravel(actions, targetFloor, agent.homeFloor);\n        actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: agent.homeFloor, wp: agent.deskDoorWpName });\n        actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: agent.homeFloor, wp: agent.deskWpName });\n        actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"AT_DESK\" });\n        actions.push({ type: \"SIT\", floor: agent.homeFloor, wp: agent.deskWpName });\n        actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(20, 50) });\n        actions.push({ type: \"PICK_NEXT_ACTIVITY\" });\n        return actions;\n    }\n\n    function planVisitCoworker(agent) {\n        const candidates = [];\n        for (let i = 0; i < agents.length; i += 1) {\n            const other = agents[i];\n            if (other.id === agent.id) continue;\n            if (other.role === \"WORKER\" && other.state === \"AT_DESK\") candidates.push(other);\n        }\n        if (!candidates.length) return planWorkAtDesk(agent);\n        const coworker = randomChoice(candidates);\n        const targetFloor = coworker.homeFloor;\n        const actions = [\n            { type: \"STAND\" },\n            { type: \"RELEASE_SEAT\" }\n        ];\n        appendTravel(actions, agent.floor, targetFloor);\n        actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: targetFloor, wp: coworker.deskDoorWpName });\n        actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"VISITING\" });\n        actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(6, 18) });\n        appendTravel(actions, targetFloor, agent.homeFloor);\n        actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: agent.homeFloor, wp: agent.deskDoorWpName });\n        actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: agent.homeFloor, wp: agent.deskWpName });\n        actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"AT_DESK\" });\n        actions.push({ type: \"SIT\", floor: agent.homeFloor, wp: agent.deskWpName });\n        actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(20, 45) });\n        actions.push({ type: \"PICK_NEXT_ACTIVITY\" });\n        return actions;\n    }\n\n    function planWorkAtDesk(agent) {\n        const actions = [];\n        if (agent.floor !== agent.homeFloor) appendTravel(actions, agent.floor, agent.homeFloor);\n        actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: agent.homeFloor, wp: agent.deskDoorWpName });\n        actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: agent.homeFloor, wp: agent.deskWpName });\n        actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"AT_DESK\" });\n        actions.push({ type: \"SIT\", floor: agent.homeFloor, wp: agent.deskWpName });\n        actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(18, 65) });\n        actions.push({ type: \"PICK_NEXT_ACTIVITY\" });\n        return actions;\n    }\n\n    function planVisitorVisit(agent) {\n        const actions = [\n            { type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: \"outside\" },\n            { type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: \"front_door_threshold\" },\n            { type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: \"entrance\" },\n            { type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: \"lobby_center\" }\n        ];\n        const lobby = world.floors[0];\n        const roll = Math.random();\n        let upperFloor = 0;\n\n        if (roll < 0.10) {\n            const seat = findFreeSeat(agent, 0, lobby.cafeSpots);\n            if (seat) {\n                actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: seat.wp });\n                actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"VISITING\" });\n                actions.push({ type: \"SIT\", floor: 0, wp: seat.wp });\n                actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(15, 35) });\n                actions.push({ type: \"STAND\" });\n                actions.push({ type: \"RELEASE_SEAT\", seatKey: seat.key });\n            } else {\n                actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: \"lobby_stand_center\" });\n                actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"VISITING\" });\n                actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(8, 18) });\n            }\n        } else if (roll < 0.16) {\n            actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: \"cafe_order\" });\n            actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"VISITING\" });\n            actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(5, 12) });\n        } else if (roll < 0.30) {\n            const seat = findFreeSeat(agent, 0, lobby.loungeSpots);\n            if (seat) {\n                actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: seat.wp });\n                actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"VISITING\" });\n                actions.push({ type: \"SIT\", floor: 0, wp: seat.wp });\n                actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(12, 30) });\n                actions.push({ type: \"STAND\" });\n                actions.push({ type: \"RELEASE_SEAT\", seatKey: seat.key });\n            } else {\n                actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: \"lobby_stand_NE\" });\n                actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"VISITING\" });\n                actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(8, 18) });\n            }\n        } else if (roll < 0.42) {\n            const seat = findFreeSeat(agent, 0, lobby.backSpots);\n            if (seat) {\n                actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: seat.wp });\n                actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"VISITING\" });\n                actions.push({ type: \"SIT\", floor: 0, wp: seat.wp });\n                actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(12, 30) });\n                actions.push({ type: \"STAND\" });\n                actions.push({ type: \"RELEASE_SEAT\", seatKey: seat.key });\n            } else {\n                actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: \"pit_N\" });\n                actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"VISITING\" });\n                actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(8, 18) });\n            }\n        } else if (roll < 0.52) {\n            const spot = randomChoice(lobby.standSpots) || \"reception\";\n            actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: spot });\n            actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"VISITING\" });\n            actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(5, 15) });\n        } else if (roll < 0.62) {\n            const spot = randomChoice(lobby.loiterSpots) || \"lobby_stand_center\";\n            actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: spot });\n            actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"VISITING\" });\n            actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(8, 20) });\n        } else if (roll < 0.77) {\n            upperFloor = randInt(1, WORLD.FLOOR_COUNT - 1);\n            const upper = world.floors[upperFloor];\n            const seat = findFreeSeat(agent, upperFloor, upper.loungeSpots);\n            appendTravel(actions, 0, upperFloor);\n            if (seat) {\n                actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: upperFloor, wp: seat.wp });\n                actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"AT_BREAK\" });\n                actions.push({ type: \"SIT\", floor: upperFloor, wp: seat.wp });\n                actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(10, 25) });\n                actions.push({ type: \"STAND\" });\n                actions.push({ type: \"RELEASE_SEAT\", seatKey: seat.key });\n            } else {\n                actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: upperFloor, wp: \"water_cooler\" });\n                actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"AT_BREAK\" });\n                actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(8, 18) });\n            }\n            appendTravel(actions, upperFloor, 0);\n        } else {\n            upperFloor = randInt(1, WORLD.FLOOR_COUNT - 1);\n            const upper = world.floors[upperFloor];\n            const seat = findFreeSeat(agent, upperFloor, upper.confSeats);\n            if (!seat) {\n                const spot = randomChoice(lobby.loiterSpots) || \"lobby_stand_center\";\n                actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: spot });\n                actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"VISITING\" });\n                actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(8, 20) });\n            } else {\n                appendTravel(actions, 0, upperFloor);\n                actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: upperFloor, wp: \"conf_center\" });\n                actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: upperFloor, wp: seat.wp });\n                actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"IN_MEETING\" });\n                actions.push({ type: \"SIT\", floor: upperFloor, wp: seat.wp });\n                actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(20, 40) });\n                actions.push({ type: \"STAND\" });\n                actions.push({ type: \"RELEASE_SEAT\", seatKey: seat.key });\n                appendTravel(actions, upperFloor, 0);\n            }\n        }\n\n        void upperFloor;\n        appendExitBuilding(actions);\n        return actions;\n    }\n\n    function chooseNextActivity(agent) {\n        if (agent.role === \"VISITOR\") {\n            agent.plan = planVisitorVisit(agent);\n            return;\n        }\n        const now = simClock.simMinute;\n        if (now >= agent.departureTime) {\n            agent.plan = planLeaveBuilding(agent);\n            return;\n        }\n\n        const remainingMeetings = [];\n        let meetingDue = false;\n        for (let i = 0; i < agent.plannedMeetingTimes.length; i += 1) {\n            const meetingTime = agent.plannedMeetingTimes[i];\n            if (now >= meetingTime && now - meetingTime < 120) {\n                meetingDue = true;\n            } else if (now < meetingTime) {\n                remainingMeetings.push(meetingTime);\n            }\n        }\n        agent.plannedMeetingTimes = remainingMeetings;\n        if (meetingDue) {\n            agent.plan = planAttendMeeting(agent);\n            return;\n        }\n\n        if (!agent.hasLunched && now >= agent.lunchTime && now < 15 * 60) {\n            agent.plan = planGoToLunch(agent);\n            return;\n        }\n\n        const roll = Math.random();\n        if (roll < 0.14) {\n            agent.plan = planAttendMeeting(agent);\n        } else if (roll < 0.26) {\n            agent.plan = planVisitLounge(agent);\n        } else if (roll < 0.41) {\n            agent.plan = planVisitCoworker(agent);\n        } else {\n            agent.plan = planWorkAtDesk(agent);\n        }\n    }\n\n    function maybeDepart(agent) {\n        if (agent.role !== \"WORKER\" || agent.leaving) return;\n        if (simClock.simMinute < agent.departureTime) return;\n        if (agent.state === \"GONE\" || agent.state === \"AWAY\" || agent.state === \"DISABLED\") return;\n        if (agent.state === \"IN_CAR\" || agent.state === \"WAITING_ELEVATOR\") return;\n        const action = agent.currentAction;\n        if (action && (action.type === \"WAIT_AT_PANEL\" || action.type === \"ENTER_ELEVATOR\" ||\n            action.type === \"PRESS_FLOOR\" || action.type === \"WAIT_FOR_FLOOR\" ||\n            action.type === \"EXIT_ELEVATOR\")) {\n            return;\n        }\n        releaseAgentSeats(agent);\n        agent.plan = planLeaveBuilding(agent);\n        agent.currentAction = null;\n    }\n\n    function isEntranceWaypoint(name) {\n        return ENTRANCE_WAYPOINTS.indexOf(name) !== -1;\n    }\n\n    function buildWalkPath(agent, floor, wpName) {\n        const floorData = world.floors[floor];\n        if (!floorData) {\n            agent.path = [];\n            agent.pathIndex = 0;\n            return;\n        }\n        const targetNode = floorData.nodes[wpName];\n        if (!targetNode) {\n            agent.path = [];\n            agent.pathIndex = 0;\n            return;\n        }\n        const startName = world.nearestNode(floorData.nodes, agent.group.position);\n        let path = world.bfsPath(floorData.nodes, startName, wpName);\n        if (!path.length) path = [targetNode.pos.clone()];\n        agent.path = path;\n        agent.pathIndex = 0;\n        if (path.length > 1 && path[0].distanceTo(agent.group.position) < 0.55) {\n            agent.pathIndex = 1;\n        }\n        agent._prevPos = agent.group.position.clone();\n        agent._stallT = 0;\n    }\n\n    function walkAlongPath(agent, dt) {\n        if (!agent.path || agent.pathIndex >= agent.path.length) return true;\n        let budget = AGENT_WALK_SPEED * dt;\n        let guard = 0;\n        while (budget > 0 && agent.pathIndex < agent.path.length && guard < 40) {\n            guard += 1;\n            const target = agent.path[agent.pathIndex];\n            const pos = agent.group.position;\n            const dx = target.x - pos.x;\n            const dz = target.z - pos.z;\n            const dist = Math.sqrt(dx * dx + dz * dz);\n            if (dist < 0.12) {\n                agent.pathIndex += 1;\n                continue;\n            }\n            const step = Math.min(dist, budget);\n            pos.x += dx / dist * step;\n            pos.z += dz / dist * step;\n            pos.y = agent.floor * WORLD.FLOOR_HEIGHT;\n            agent.group.rotation.y = Math.atan2(dx, dz);\n            budget -= step;\n        }\n        if (agent.pathIndex >= agent.path.length) return true;\n\n        const prev = agent._prevPos || agent.group.position.clone();\n        const moved = agent.group.position.distanceTo(prev);\n        if (moved < 0.005) {\n            agent._stallT = (agent._stallT || 0) + dt;\n            if (agent._stallT > 1.2) {\n                agent.pathIndex += 1;\n                agent._stallT = 0;\n                const action = agent.currentAction;\n                if (action && action.type === \"WALK_TO_WP\" && isEntranceWaypoint(action.wp) &&\n                    agent.pathIndex < agent.path.length) {\n                    const next = agent.path[agent.pathIndex];\n                    agent.group.position.x = next.x;\n                    agent.group.position.z = next.z;\n                }\n            }\n        } else {\n            agent._stallT = 0;\n        }\n        agent._prevPos = agent.group.position.clone();\n        return false;\n    }\n\n    function startAction(agent, action) {\n        if (action.type === \"WALK_TO_WP\") {\n            buildWalkPath(agent, action.floor, action.wp);\n            agent.state = agent.state === \"AT_DESK\" ? \"ON_FLOOR\" : agent.state;\n            if (agent.state === \"AT_DESK\" || agent.state === \"IN_MEETING\" ||\n                agent.state === \"AT_BREAK\" || agent.state === \"AT_LUNCH\" ||\n                agent.state === \"VISITING\") {\n                agent.state = \"ON_FLOOR\";\n            }\n        } else if (action.type === \"WAIT_AT_PANEL\") {\n            agent.state = \"WAITING_ELEVATOR\";\n            action.dir = action.toFloor > action.floor ? 1 : -1;\n            if (action.dir > 0) elevator.callUp(action.floor);\n            else elevator.callDown(action.floor);\n        } else if (action.type === \"ENTER_ELEVATOR\") {\n            action.phase = \"reserve\";\n            action.spot = null;\n            action._stallT = 0;\n        } else if (action.type === \"EXIT_ELEVATOR\") {\n            elevator.registerDisembark(agent);\n            scene.attach(agent.group);\n            agent.floor = action.toFloor;\n            agent.group.position.y = agent.floor * WORLD.FLOOR_HEIGHT;\n            agent.state = \"ON_FLOOR\";\n            action._exitTarget = world.floors[action.toFloor].nodes.elevWait.pos.clone();\n            action._prevPos = agent.group.position.clone();\n            action._stallT = 0;\n        } else if (action.type === \"SIT\") {\n            const floorData = world.floors[action.floor];\n            const node = floorData.nodes[action.wp];\n            const target = floorData.sitTargets[action.wp] || { sit: false, facing: 0 };\n            if (node) {\n                let x = node.pos.x;\n                let z = node.pos.z;\n                if (!target.sit) {\n                    const angle = Math.random() * Math.PI * 2;\n                    const radius = 0.35 + Math.random() * 0.4;\n                    x += Math.cos(angle) * radius;\n                    z += Math.sin(angle) * radius;\n                }\n                agent.floor = action.floor;\n                agent.group.position.set(x, action.floor * WORLD.FLOOR_HEIGHT, z);\n                agent.group.rotation.y = target.facing;\n                agent.group.userData.isSitting = Boolean(target.sit);\n                agent.group.userData.isWalking = false;\n                if (target.sit) agent.group.position.y = action.floor * WORLD.FLOOR_HEIGHT - 0.35;\n            }\n        } else if (action.type === \"STAND\") {\n            agent.group.userData.isSitting = false;\n            agent.group.userData.isWalking = false;\n            if (agent.group.parent === elevator.carGroup) {\n                agent.group.position.y = 0;\n            } else {\n                agent.group.position.y = agent.floor * WORLD.FLOOR_HEIGHT;\n            }\n        } else if (action.type === \"RELEASE_SEAT\") {\n            if (action.seatKey) releaseSeatKey(agent, action.seatKey);\n            else releaseAgentSeats(agent);\n        } else if (action.type === \"WAIT_SIM\") {\n            action.untilMin = simClock.simMinute + (action.minutes || 0);\n        } else if (action.type === \"EXIT_BUILDING\") {\n            releaseAgentSeats(agent);\n            if (agent.group.parent) agent.group.parent.remove(agent.group);\n            agent.group.visible = false;\n            agent.state = \"GONE\";\n            agent.leaving = false;\n        } else if (action.type === \"PRESS_FLOOR\") {\n            elevator.pressDestination(action.floor);\n            agent.state = \"IN_CAR\";\n        } else if (action.type === \"WAIT_FOR_FLOOR\") {\n            agent.state = \"IN_CAR\";\n        } else if (action.type === \"ENTER_STATE\") {\n            agent.state = action.state;\n        } else if (action.type === \"MARK_LUNCHED\") {\n            agent.hasLunched = true;\n        } else if (action.type === \"PICK_NEXT_ACTIVITY\") {\n            chooseNextActivity(agent);\n        }\n        action._started = true;\n    }\n\n    function processAction(agent, action, dt) {\n        if (!action._started) startAction(agent, action);\n\n        if (action.type === \"WALK_TO_WP\") {\n            return walkAlongPath(agent, dt);\n        }\n\n        if (action.type === \"WAIT_AT_PANEL\") {\n            const dir = action.dir;\n            if (elevator.state === \"DOOR_OPEN\" && elevator.currentFloor === action.floor &&\n                elevator.isAcceptingAt(action.floor, dir) && elevator.currentCapacityFree() > 0) {\n                return true;\n            }\n            if (dir > 0) elevator.callUp(action.floor);\n            else elevator.callDown(action.floor);\n            return false;\n        }\n\n        if (action.type === \"ENTER_ELEVATOR\") {\n            const floorY = action.floor * WORLD.FLOOR_HEIGHT;\n            const dir = action.toFloor > action.floor ? 1 : -1;\n            if (action.phase === \"reserve\") {\n                if (!elevator.isAcceptingAt(action.floor, dir) || elevator.currentCapacityFree() <= 0) {\n                    if (dir > 0) elevator.callUp(action.floor);\n                    else elevator.callDown(action.floor);\n                    return false;\n                }\n                action.spot = elevator.reserveBoardingSpot(agent);\n                if (!action.spot) return false;\n                action.phase = \"door\";\n                action._prevPos = agent.group.position.clone();\n                action._stallT = 0;\n            }\n\n            if (action.phase === \"door\") {\n                const targetX = action.spot.x;\n                const targetZ = 1.42;\n                const pos = agent.group.position;\n                const dx = targetX - pos.x;\n                const dz = targetZ - pos.z;\n                const dist = Math.sqrt(dx * dx + dz * dz);\n                const step = AGENT_WALK_SPEED * dt;\n                if (dist <= 0.3 || step >= dist) {\n                    pos.set(targetX, floorY, targetZ);\n                    action.phase = \"inside\";\n                } else {\n                    pos.x += dx / dist * step;\n                    pos.z += dz / dist * step;\n                    pos.y = floorY;\n                    agent.group.rotation.y = Math.atan2(dx, dz);\n                    const moved = pos.distanceTo(action._prevPos);\n                    action._stallT = (action._stallT || 0) + dt;\n                    if (moved < 0.005 && action._stallT > 1.5) {\n                        pos.set(targetX, floorY, targetZ);\n                        action.phase = \"inside\";\n                        action._stallT = 0;\n                    } else if (moved >= 0.005) {\n                        action._stallT = 0;\n                    }\n                    action._prevPos = pos.clone();\n                }\n            }\n\n            if (action.phase === \"inside\") {\n                elevator.carGroup.attach(agent.group);\n                agent.state = \"IN_CAR\";\n                action.phase = \"spot\";\n            }\n\n            if (action.phase === \"spot\") {\n                const pos = agent.group.position;\n                const dx = action.spot.x - pos.x;\n                const dz = action.spot.z - pos.z;\n                const dist = Math.sqrt(dx * dx + dz * dz);\n                const step = AGENT_WALK_SPEED * dt;\n                if (dist <= 0.08 || step >= dist) {\n                    pos.set(action.spot.x, 0, action.spot.z);\n                    agent.group.rotation.y = 0;\n                    elevator.completeBoard(agent);\n                    return true;\n                }\n                pos.x += dx / dist * step;\n                pos.z += dz / dist * step;\n                pos.y = 0;\n                return false;\n            }\n            return false;\n        }\n\n        if (action.type === \"PRESS_FLOOR\") {\n            elevator.pressDestination(action.floor);\n            agent.state = \"IN_CAR\";\n            return true;\n        }\n\n        if (action.type === \"WAIT_FOR_FLOOR\") {\n            agent.state = \"IN_CAR\";\n            return elevator.state === \"DOOR_OPEN\" && elevator.currentFloor === action.floor;\n        }\n\n        if (action.type === \"EXIT_ELEVATOR\") {\n            const target = action._exitTarget;\n            const pos = agent.group.position;\n            const dx = target.x - pos.x;\n            const dz = target.z - pos.z;\n            const dist = Math.sqrt(dx * dx + dz * dz);\n            const step = AGENT_WALK_SPEED * dt;\n            if (dist <= 0.25 || step >= dist) {\n                pos.x = target.x;\n                pos.z = target.z;\n                pos.y = agent.floor * WORLD.FLOOR_HEIGHT;\n                elevator.completeDisembark(agent);\n                return true;\n            }\n            pos.x += dx / dist * step;\n            pos.z += dz / dist * step;\n            pos.y = agent.floor * WORLD.FLOOR_HEIGHT;\n            agent.group.rotation.y = Math.atan2(dx, dz);\n            const moved = pos.distanceTo(action._prevPos);\n            action._stallT = (action._stallT || 0) + dt;\n            if (moved < 0.005 && action._stallT > 1.5) {\n                pos.x = target.x;\n                pos.z = target.z;\n                elevator.completeDisembark(agent);\n                return true;\n            } else if (moved >= 0.005) {\n                action._stallT = 0;\n            }\n            action._prevPos = pos.clone();\n            return false;\n        }\n\n        if (action.type === \"WAIT_SIM\") {\n            return simClock.simMinute >= action.untilMin;\n        }\n\n        if (action.type === \"SIT\" || action.type === \"STAND\" || action.type === \"RELEASE_SEAT\" ||\n            action.type === \"EXIT_BUILDING\" || action.type === \"ENTER_STATE\" ||\n            action.type === \"MARK_LUNCHED\" || action.type === \"PICK_NEXT_ACTIVITY\") {\n            return true;\n        }\n\n        return true;\n    }\n\n    function dispatchActions(agent, dt) {\n        let guard = 0;\n        while (guard < 16) {\n            guard += 1;\n            if (!agent.currentAction) {\n                if (agent.plan && agent.plan.length) {\n                    agent.currentAction = agent.plan.shift();\n                } else {\n                    chooseNextActivity(agent);\n                    if (!agent.plan || !agent.plan.length) break;\n                    continue;\n                }\n            }\n            const done = processAction(agent, agent.currentAction, dt);\n            if (!done) break;\n            agent.currentAction = null;\n            if (agent.state === \"GONE\" || agent.state === \"DISABLED\") break;\n        }\n    }\n\n    function updateAgents(dt) {\n        for (let i = 0; i < agents.length; i += 1) {\n            const agent = agents[i];\n            if (agent.state === \"DISABLED\") continue;\n            if (agent.state === \"AWAY\") {\n                maybeSpawn(agent);\n                continue;\n            }\n            if (agent.state === \"GONE\") continue;\n            maybeDepart(agent);\n            dispatchActions(agent, dt);\n        }\n    }\n\n    function collisionExempt(agent) {\n        const action = agent.currentAction;\n        if (!action) return false;\n        if (action.type === \"ENTER_ELEVATOR\" || action.type === \"EXIT_ELEVATOR\") return true;\n        if (action.type === \"WALK_TO_WP\" && isEntranceWaypoint(action.wp)) return true;\n        return false;\n    }\n\n    function applyCollisions() {\n        for (let i = 0; i < agents.length; i += 1) {\n            const a = agents[i];\n            if (!a.group.parent || !a.group.visible || a.group.userData.isSitting) continue;\n            if (a.group.parent === elevator.carGroup) continue;\n            if (collisionExempt(a)) continue;\n            for (let j = i + 1; j < agents.length; j += 1) {\n                const b = agents[j];\n                if (!b.group.parent || !b.group.visible || b.group.userData.isSitting) continue;\n                if (b.group.parent === elevator.carGroup) continue;\n                if (a.group.parent !== b.group.parent) continue;\n                if (collisionExempt(b)) continue;\n                const dy = a.group.position.y - b.group.position.y;\n                if (Math.abs(dy) > 1.2) continue;\n                let dx = a.group.position.x - b.group.position.x;\n                let dz = a.group.position.z - b.group.position.z;\n                let dist = Math.sqrt(dx * dx + dz * dz);\n                if (dist >= AGENT_SEPARATION) continue;\n                let nx;\n                let nz;\n                if (dist < 0.001) {\n                    const angle = Math.random() * Math.PI * 2;\n                    nx = Math.cos(angle);\n                    nz = Math.sin(angle);\n                    dist = 0;\n                } else {\n                    nx = dx / dist;\n                    nz = dz / dist;\n                }\n                const push = (AGENT_SEPARATION - dist) * 0.18;\n                a.group.position.x += nx * push;\n                a.group.position.z += nz * push;\n                b.group.position.x -= nx * push;\n                b.group.position.z -= nz * push;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    function updateLighting() {\n        const hour = simClock.simMinute / 60;\n        let first = DAY_KEYFRAMES[0];\n        let second = DAY_KEYFRAMES[DAY_KEYFRAMES.length - 1];\n        for (let i = 0; i < DAY_KEYFRAMES.length - 1; i += 1) {\n            if (hour >= DAY_KEYFRAMES[i].hour && hour <= DAY_KEYFRAMES[i + 1].hour) {\n                first = DAY_KEYFRAMES[i];\n                second = DAY_KEYFRAMES[i + 1];\n                break;\n            }\n        }\n        const span = second.hour - first.hour || 1;\n        const t = Math.max(0, Math.min(1, (hour - first.hour) / span));\n        const bgA = new THREE.Color(first.bg);\n        const bgB = new THREE.Color(second.bg);\n        const sunA = new THREE.Color(first.sun);\n        const sunB = new THREE.Color(second.sun);\n        if (scene.background && scene.background.isColor) {\n            scene.background.copy(bgA).lerp(bgB, t);\n        }\n        if (sunLight) {\n            sunLight.color.copy(sunA).lerp(sunB, t);\n            sunLight.intensity = first.sunInt + (second.sunInt - first.sunInt) * t;\n        }\n        if (ambientLight) {\n            ambientLight.intensity = first.amb + (second.amb - first.amb) * t;\n        }\n        if (hemiLight) {\n            hemiLight.intensity = first.hemi + (second.hemi - first.hemi) * t;\n        }\n    }\n\n    function updateHUD() {\n        if (hudTime) hudTime.textContent = simClock.format();\n        if (!hudStats) return;\n        const counts = {};\n        for (let i = 0; i < agents.length; i += 1) {\n            const state = agents[i].state;\n            counts[state] = (counts[state] || 0) + 1;\n        }\n        const stateParts = [];\n        const order = [\"AT_DESK\", \"IN_MEETING\", \"AT_BREAK\", \"AT_LUNCH\", \"VISITING\",\n            \"WAITING_ELEVATOR\", \"IN_CAR\", \"ON_FLOOR\", \"ARRIVING\", \"LEAVING\", \"AWAY\", \"GONE\", \"DISABLED\"];\n        for (let i = 0; i < order.length; i += 1) {\n            if (counts[order[i]]) stateParts.push(order[i] + \":\" + counts[order[i]]);\n        }\n        const directionText = elevator.direction > 0 ? \"UP\" : (elevator.direction < 0 ? \"DOWN\" : \"-\");\n        const destList = Array.from(elevator.destinations).sort(function (a, b) { return a - b; }).join(\",\");\n        const upList = Array.from(elevator.upCalls).sort(function (a, b) { return a - b; }).join(\",\");\n        const downList = Array.from(elevator.downCalls).sort(function (a, b) { return a - b; }).join(\",\");\n        hudStats.textContent =\n            \"People: \" + countPresent() + \" present / \" + targetOccupancy + \" target\\n\" +\n            stateParts.join(\"  \") + \"\\n\" +\n            \"Elevator: floor \" + elevator.currentFloor + \" \" + directionText +\n            \" | \" + elevator.state + \" | riders \" + elevator.passengers.size +\n            \"\\nDest: [\" + destList + \"]  Up: [\" + upList + \"]  Down: [\" + downList + \"]\";\n    }\n\n    function buildHUD() {\n        const hud = document.createElement(\"div\");\n        hud.style.position = \"fixed\";\n        hud.style.left = \"12px\";\n        hud.style.top = \"12px\";\n        hud.style.zIndex = \"10\";\n        hud.style.padding = \"12px 14px\";\n        hud.style.background = \"rgba(10, 14, 20, 0.72)\";\n        hud.style.color = \"#e8eef6\";\n        hud.style.fontFamily = \"monospace\";\n        hud.style.fontSize = \"12px\";\n        hud.style.border = \"1px solid rgba(150, 180, 220, 0.3)\";\n        hud.style.borderRadius = \"8px\";\n        hud.style.minWidth = \"330px\";\n        hud.style.whiteSpace = \"pre\";\n        hud.style.pointerEvents = \"auto\";\n\n        hudTime = document.createElement(\"div\");\n        hudTime.style.fontSize = \"26px\";\n        hudTime.style.fontWeight = \"bold\";\n        hudTime.style.color = \"#ffcc55\";\n        hudTime.style.marginBottom = \"8px\";\n        hudTime.textContent = simClock.format();\n        hud.appendChild(hudTime);\n\n        const speedLabel = document.createElement(\"div\");\n        speedLabel.textContent = \"Speed: 120x realtime\";\n        hud.appendChild(speedLabel);\n        const speedSlider = document.createElement(\"input\");\n        speedSlider.type = \"range\";\n        speedSlider.min = \"0\";\n        speedSlider.max = \"100\";\n        speedSlider.step = \"1\";\n        speedSlider.value = String(Math.round(Math.log(120) / Math.log(600) * 100));\n        speedSlider.style.width = \"100%\";\n        speedSlider.addEventListener(\"input\", function () {\n            const t = Number(speedSlider.value) / 100;\n            simClock.timeScale = Math.exp(t * Math.log(600));\n            speedLabel.textContent = \"Speed: \" + Math.round(simClock.timeScale) + \"x realtime\";\n        });\n        hud.appendChild(speedSlider);\n\n        hudOccupancy = document.createElement(\"div\");\n        hudOccupancy.textContent = \"Occupancy: \" + targetOccupancy + \" / \" + SIM_MAX_OCCUPANCY + \" people\";\n        hudOccupancy.style.marginTop = \"8px\";\n        hud.appendChild(hudOccupancy);\n        const occupancySlider = document.createElement(\"input\");\n        occupancySlider.type = \"range\";\n        occupancySlider.min = \"1\";\n        occupancySlider.max = String(SIM_MAX_OCCUPANCY);\n        occupancySlider.step = \"1\";\n        occupancySlider.value = String(targetOccupancy);\n        occupancySlider.style.width = \"100%\";\n        occupancySlider.addEventListener(\"input\", function () {\n            targetOccupancy = Number(occupancySlider.value);\n            applyOccupancy();\n        });\n        hud.appendChild(occupancySlider);\n\n        hudStats = document.createElement(\"div\");\n        hudStats.style.marginTop = \"10px\";\n        hudStats.style.lineHeight = \"1.5\";\n        hudStats.style.fontSize = \"11px\";\n        hud.appendChild(hudStats);\n        document.body.appendChild(hud);\n    }\n\n    function startSimulation() {\n        scene = new THREE.Scene();\n        scene.background = new THREE.Color(0x20242a);\n        camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(60, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n        camera.position.set(28, 24, 28);\n        renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ antialias: true, alpha: true });\n        renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n        renderer.sortObjects = true;\n        document.body.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n        controls = new THREE.OrbitControls(camera, renderer.domElement);\n        controls.target.set(0, 6, 0);\n        controls.update();\n\n        ambientLight = new THREE.AmbientLight(0xffffff, 0.45);\n        scene.add(ambientLight);\n        hemiLight = new THREE.HemisphereLight(0xbfd7ff, 0x303020, 0.45);\n        scene.add(hemiLight);\n        sunLight = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff, 0.9);\n        sunLight.position.set(20, 35, 18);\n        scene.add(sunLight);\n\n        world = createWorld(scene);\n        elevator = new Elevator(scene, world);\n        buildAgents();\n        applyOccupancy();\n        buildHUD();\n        simClock.onNewDay = resetDay;\n        updateLighting();\n\n        window.addEventListener(\"resize\", function () {\n            camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n            camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n        });\n\n        function animate() {\n            requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n            const now = performance.now();\n            let realDt = 0.016;\n            if (lastFrameMs > 0) realDt = (now - lastFrameMs) / 1000;\n            lastFrameMs = now;\n            realDt = Math.min(0.05, realDt);\n\n            simClock.tick(realDt);\n            updateLighting();\n            const motionDt = realDt * simClock.timeScale;\n            elevator.tick(motionDt);\n            updateAgents(motionDt);\n            topUpVisitors();\n            applyCollisions();\n\n            for (let i = 0; i < agents.length; i += 1) {\n                const agent = agents[i];\n                if (agent.group.parent) animatePersonWalking(agent.group, motionDt);\n            }\n\n            controls.update();\n            renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            updateHUD();\n        }\n\n        animate();\n    }\n\n    if (document.readyState === \"loading\") {\n        window.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", startSimulation);\n    } else {\n        startSimulation();\n    }\n})();\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash-1017","usage":{"input":173,"output":29438,"cacheRead":71360,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":13780,"totalTokens":100971,"cost":{"input":0.00007477925,"output":0.053577160000000006,"cacheRead":0.005195008,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.058846947250000003}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1792295020570,"responseId":"gen-1792295021-HQ7SqnaKod9fP7UbJXsO","rawStopReason":"tool_calls","durationMs":158427,"thinkingLevel":"medium"}}
{"type":"tool_execution_start","toolCallId":"chatcmpl-tool-8d374b0e478ca42e","toolName":"write","args":{"path":"/home/jeff/Code/llm-eval/evals/pi_openrouter_deepseek_deepseek-v4_1-flash-1017_office_prompt_v3/sim.js","content":"/* sim.js - simulated clock, office workers, visitors, lighting and render loop. */\n(function () {\n    \"use strict\";\n\n    const SIM_MAX_WORKERS = 20;\n    const SIM_MAX_VISITORS = 80;\n    const SIM_MAX_OCCUPANCY = SIM_MAX_WORKERS + SIM_MAX_VISITORS;\n    const SIM_DEFAULT_OCCUPANCY = 45;\n    const AGENT_WALK_SPEED = 1.35;\n    const AGENT_SEPARATION = 0.78;\n    const ENTRANCE_WAYPOINTS = [\"outside\", \"front_door_threshold\", \"entrance\", \"lobby_center\"];\n\n    const FIRST_NAMES = [\n        \"Ava\", \"Ben\", \"Cara\", \"Dev\", \"Elena\", \"Finn\", \"Gina\", \"Hugo\", \"Iris\", \"Jack\",\n        \"Kira\", \"Liam\", \"Maya\", \"Nico\", \"Olive\", \"Pablo\", \"Quinn\", \"Rosa\", \"Sam\", \"Tara\",\n        \"Uma\", \"Vince\", \"Willa\", \"Xander\", \"Yara\", \"Zane\", \"Noah\", \"Mia\", \"Owen\", \"Ruby\"\n    ];\n\n    const DAY_KEYFRAMES = [\n        { hour: 0, bg: 0x111827, sun: 0x8899bb, sunInt: 0.12, amb: 0.45, hemi: 0.32 },\n        { hour: 5.5, bg: 0x111827, sun: 0x8899bb, sunInt: 0.12, amb: 0.45, hemi: 0.32 },\n        { hour: 6.0, bg: 0x2b2b3d, sun: 0xffb066, sunInt: 0.35, amb: 0.48, hemi: 0.35 },\n        { hour: 6.5, bg: 0x8fb7d9, sun: 0xffe0b0, sunInt: 0.8, amb: 0.55, hemi: 0.5 },\n        { hour: 7.0, bg: 0xbfd9ef, sun: 0xfff2cc, sunInt: 1.0, amb: 0.55, hemi: 0.55 },\n        { hour: 12.0, bg: 0xcfe6f7, sun: 0xffffff, sunInt: 1.05, amb: 0.55, hemi: 0.55 },\n        { hour: 17.0, bg: 0xd9c8a8, sun: 0xffd28a, sunInt: 0.9, amb: 0.52, hemi: 0.5 },\n        { hour: 17.5, bg: 0xb97b52, sun: 0xff9a55, sunInt: 0.55, amb: 0.48, hemi: 0.42 },\n        { hour: 18.0, bg: 0x5c4a5e, sun: 0xcc7744, sunInt: 0.3, amb: 0.46, hemi: 0.36 },\n        { hour: 18.5, bg: 0x1b2233, sun: 0x7788aa, sunInt: 0.14, amb: 0.45, hemi: 0.32 },\n        { hour: 24, bg: 0x111827, sun: 0x8899bb, sunInt: 0.12, amb: 0.45, hemi: 0.32 }\n    ];\n\n    let scene = null;\n    let camera = null;\n    let renderer = null;\n    let controls = null;\n    let world = null;\n    let elevator = null;\n    let sunLight = null;\n    let ambientLight = null;\n    let hemiLight = null;\n    let agents = [];\n    let seatReservations = new Set();\n    let targetOccupancy = SIM_DEFAULT_OCCUPANCY;\n    let hudTime = null;\n    let hudStats = null;\n    let hudOccupancy = null;\n    let lastFrameMs = 0;\n\n    const simClock = {\n        simMinute: 7 * 60 + 30,\n        timeScale: 120,\n        onNewDay: null,\n        tick: function (realDt) {\n            this.simMinute += realDt * this.timeScale / 60;\n            if (this.simMinute >= 24 * 60) {\n                this.simMinute -= 24 * 60;\n                if (this.onNewDay) this.onNewDay();\n            }\n        },\n        format: function () {\n            const total = Math.floor(this.simMinute) % (24 * 60);\n            let hour = Math.floor(total / 60);\n            const minute = total % 60;\n            const suffix = hour >= 12 ? \"PM\" : \"AM\";\n            hour = hour % 12;\n            if (hour === 0) hour = 12;\n            return \" \" + hour + \":\" + String(minute).padStart(2, \"0\") + \" \" + suffix;\n        }\n    };\n\n    function randInt(min, max) {\n        return Math.floor(Math.random() * (max - min + 1)) + min;\n    }\n\n    function randomChoice(list) {\n        if (!list || !list.length) return null;\n        return list[Math.floor(Math.random() * list.length)];\n    }\n\n    function seatKey(floor, wpName) {\n        return String(floor) + \":\" + wpName;\n    }\n\n    function reserveSeat(agent, floor, wpName) {\n        const key = seatKey(floor, wpName);\n        if (seatReservations.has(key)) return null;\n        seatReservations.add(key);\n        if (agent.reservedSeats.indexOf(key) === -1) agent.reservedSeats.push(key);\n        return key;\n    }\n\n    function releaseSeatKey(agent, key) {\n        if (!key) return;\n        seatReservations.delete(key);\n        const index = agent.reservedSeats.indexOf(key);\n        if (index >= 0) agent.reservedSeats.splice(index, 1);\n    }\n\n    function releaseAgentSeats(agent) {\n        for (let i = 0; i < agent.reservedSeats.length; i += 1) {\n            seatReservations.delete(agent.reservedSeats[i]);\n        }\n        agent.reservedSeats = [];\n    }\n\n    function findFreeSeat(agent, floor, names) {\n        if (!names || !names.length) return null;\n        const start = Math.floor(Math.random() * names.length);\n        for (let offset = 0; offset < names.length; offset += 1) {\n            const wpName = names[(start + offset) % names.length];\n            const key = reserveSeat(agent, floor, wpName);\n            if (key) return { wp: wpName, key: key };\n        }\n        return null;\n    }\n\n    function resampleSchedule(agent, initial) {\n        releaseAgentSeats(agent);\n        agent.hasLunched = false;\n        agent.leaving = false;\n        agent.plan = [];\n        agent.currentAction = null;\n        agent.path = [];\n        agent.pathIndex = 0;\n        agent.group.userData.isSitting = false;\n        agent.group.userData.isWalking = false;\n        agent.plannedMeetingTimes = [];\n\n        if (agent.role === \"WORKER\") {\n            agent.arrivalTime = randInt(8 * 60 + 15, 9 * 60 + 30);\n            agent.lunchTime = randInt(11 * 60 + 30, 13 * 60 + 30);\n            agent.lunchDuration = randInt(25, 60);\n            agent.departureTime = randInt(16 * 60 + 45, 18 * 60 + 30);\n            if (Math.random() < 0.15) agent.departureTime = randInt(18 * 60 + 30, 19 * 60 + 45);\n            if (Math.random() < 0.65) agent.plannedMeetingTimes.push(randInt(9 * 60 + 30, 11 * 60 + 20));\n            if (Math.random() < 0.6) agent.plannedMeetingTimes.push(randInt(13 * 60 + 30, 16 * 60));\n            agent.plannedMeetingTimes.sort(function (a, b) { return a - b; });\n        } else {\n            if (initial) {\n                agent.arrivalTime = randInt(8 * 60, 10 * 60);\n            } else {\n                agent.arrivalTime = simClock.simMinute + randInt(0, 6);\n            }\n            agent.visitDuration = randInt(30, 100);\n            agent.lunchTime = randInt(11 * 60 + 30, 13 * 60 + 30);\n            agent.lunchDuration = randInt(25, 50);\n            agent.departureTime = agent.arrivalTime + agent.visitDuration;\n        }\n    }\n\n    function buildAgents() {\n        const deskPool = [];\n        for (let floor = 1; floor < WORLD.FLOOR_COUNT; floor += 1) {\n            const desks = world.floors[floor].desks;\n            for (let i = 0; i < desks.length; i += 1) deskPool.push(desks[i]);\n        }\n\n        for (let i = 0; i < SIM_MAX_WORKERS; i += 1) {\n            const desk = deskPool[i % deskPool.length];\n            const group = createPerson();\n            group.visible = false;\n            group.position.set(0, 0, 12);\n            scene.add(group);\n            const agent = {\n                id: i,\n                role: \"WORKER\",\n                name: FIRST_NAMES[i % FIRST_NAMES.length],\n                group: group,\n                state: \"AWAY\",\n                floor: 0,\n                plan: [],\n                currentAction: null,\n                path: [],\n                pathIndex: 0,\n                homeFloor: desk.floor,\n                deskId: desk.id,\n                deskWpName: desk.wp,\n                deskDoorWpName: desk.door,\n                arrivalTime: 0,\n                lunchTime: 0,\n                lunchDuration: 30,\n                departureTime: 0,\n                hasLunched: false,\n                plannedMeetingTimes: [],\n                visitDuration: 0,\n                reservedSeats: [],\n                leaving: false\n            };\n            group.userData.agent = agent;\n            agents.push(agent);\n            resampleSchedule(agent, true);\n        }\n\n        for (let v = 0; v < SIM_MAX_VISITORS; v += 1) {\n            const group = createPerson();\n            group.visible = false;\n            group.position.set(0, 0, 12);\n            scene.add(group);\n            const agent = {\n                id: SIM_MAX_WORKERS + v,\n                role: \"VISITOR\",\n                name: randomChoice(FIRST_NAMES) || \"Guest\",\n                group: group,\n                state: \"AWAY\",\n                floor: 0,\n                plan: [],\n                currentAction: null,\n                path: [],\n                pathIndex: 0,\n                homeFloor: null,\n                deskId: null,\n                deskWpName: null,\n                deskDoorWpName: null,\n                arrivalTime: 0,\n                lunchTime: 0,\n                lunchDuration: 30,\n                departureTime: 0,\n                hasLunched: true,\n                plannedMeetingTimes: [],\n                visitDuration: 60,\n                reservedSeats: [],\n                leaving: false\n            };\n            group.userData.agent = agent;\n            agents.push(agent);\n            resampleSchedule(agent, true);\n        }\n    }\n\n    function applyOccupancy() {\n        for (let i = 0; i < agents.length; i += 1) {\n            const agent = agents[i];\n            const enabled = agent.id < targetOccupancy;\n            if (enabled) {\n                if (agent.state === \"DISABLED\") agent.state = \"AWAY\";\n            } else if (agent.state === \"AWAY\") {\n                agent.state = \"DISABLED\";\n            } else if (agent.state === \"GONE\") {\n                agent.state = \"DISABLED\";\n                agent.group.visible = false;\n                if (agent.group.parent) agent.group.parent.remove(agent.group);\n            }\n        }\n        if (hudOccupancy) {\n            hudOccupancy.textContent = \"Occupancy: \" + targetOccupancy + \" / \" + SIM_MAX_OCCUPANCY + \" people\";\n        }\n    }\n\n    function resetDay() {\n        seatReservations.clear();\n        for (let i = 0; i < agents.length; i += 1) {\n            const agent = agents[i];\n            agent.group.visible = false;\n            if (agent.group.parent) agent.group.parent.remove(agent.group);\n            agent.group.userData.isSitting = false;\n            agent.group.userData.isWalking = false;\n            agent.group.position.set(0, 0, 12);\n            agent.floor = 0;\n            agent.state = agent.id < targetOccupancy ? \"AWAY\" : \"DISABLED\";\n            resampleSchedule(agent, true);\n        }\n        if (elevator) elevator.reset();\n    }\n\n    function countPresent() {\n        let count = 0;\n        for (let i = 0; i < agents.length; i += 1) {\n            const state = agents[i].state;\n            if (state !== \"AWAY\" && state !== \"DISABLED\" && state !== \"GONE\") count += 1;\n        }\n        return count;\n    }\n\n    function topUpVisitors() {\n        const now = simClock.simMinute;\n        if (now < 8 * 60 || now > 18 * 60) return;\n        let deficit = targetOccupancy - countPresent();\n        if (deficit <= 0) return;\n        for (let i = 0; i < agents.length && deficit > 0; i += 1) {\n            const agent = agents[i];\n            if (agent.role !== \"VISITOR\" || agent.id >= targetOccupancy) continue;\n            if (agent.state !== \"GONE\" && agent.state !== \"AWAY\") continue;\n            if (agent.state === \"AWAY\" && agent.arrivalTime <= now + 15) continue;\n            agent.state = \"AWAY\";\n            agent.arrivalTime = now + randInt(0, 6);\n            agent.visitDuration = randInt(30, 100);\n            agent.departureTime = agent.arrivalTime + agent.visitDuration;\n            agent.hasLunched = true;\n            agent.plan = [];\n            agent.currentAction = null;\n            agent.path = [];\n            agent.pathIndex = 0;\n            releaseAgentSeats(agent);\n            agent.group.visible = false;\n            if (agent.group.parent) agent.group.parent.remove(agent.group);\n            deficit -= 1;\n        }\n    }\n\n    function spawnAgent(agent) {\n        if (agent.group.parent && agent.group.parent !== scene) {\n            scene.attach(agent.group);\n        }\n        if (!agent.group.parent) scene.add(agent.group);\n        agent.group.visible = true;\n        agent.group.userData.isSitting = false;\n        agent.group.userData.isWalking = true;\n        agent.group.position.set(\n            (Math.random() - 0.5) * 2.2,\n            0,\n            12 + (Math.random() - 0.5) * 1.5\n        );\n        agent.group.rotation.y = Math.PI;\n        agent.floor = 0;\n        agent.state = \"ARRIVING\";\n        agent.leaving = false;\n        agent.path = [];\n        agent.pathIndex = 0;\n        agent.currentAction = null;\n        releaseAgentSeats(agent);\n        if (agent.role === \"WORKER\") {\n            agent.plan = planArriveToDesk(agent);\n        } else {\n            agent.plan = planVisitorVisit(agent);\n        }\n    }\n\n    function maybeSpawn(agent) {\n        if (agent.state !== \"AWAY\") return;\n        if (agent.id >= targetOccupancy) return;\n        const now = simClock.simMinute;\n        if (now < agent.arrivalTime) return;\n        if (agent.role === \"WORKER\" && now > agent.departureTime) return;\n        if (agent.role === \"VISITOR\" && now > agent.departureTime + 10) return;\n        spawnAgent(agent);\n    }\n\n    function appendTravel(actions, fromFloor, toFloor) {\n        if (fromFloor === toFloor) return;\n        const dir = toFloor > fromFloor ? 1 : -1;\n        actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: fromFloor, wp: \"elevWait\" });\n        actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_AT_PANEL\", floor: fromFloor, dir: dir, toFloor: toFloor });\n        actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_ELEVATOR\", floor: fromFloor, toFloor: toFloor });\n        actions.push({ type: \"PRESS_FLOOR\", floor: toFloor });\n        actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_FOR_FLOOR\", floor: toFloor });\n        actions.push({ type: \"EXIT_ELEVATOR\", floor: toFloor, toFloor: toFloor });\n    }\n\n    function appendExitBuilding(actions) {\n        actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: \"lobby_center\" });\n        actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: \"entrance\" });\n        actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: \"front_door_threshold\" });\n        actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: \"outside\" });\n        actions.push({ type: \"EXIT_BUILDING\" });\n    }\n\n    function planArriveToDesk(agent) {\n        const actions = [\n            { type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: \"outside\" },\n            { type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: \"front_door_threshold\" },\n            { type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: \"entrance\" },\n            { type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: \"lobby_center\" }\n        ];\n        appendTravel(actions, 0, agent.homeFloor);\n        actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: agent.homeFloor, wp: agent.deskDoorWpName });\n        actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: agent.homeFloor, wp: agent.deskWpName });\n        actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"AT_DESK\" });\n        actions.push({ type: \"SIT\", floor: agent.homeFloor, wp: agent.deskWpName });\n        actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(20, 55) });\n        actions.push({ type: \"PICK_NEXT_ACTIVITY\" });\n        return actions;\n    }\n\n    function planLeaveBuilding(agent) {\n        agent.leaving = true;\n        releaseAgentSeats(agent);\n        const floor = agent.floor;\n        const actions = [\n            { type: \"STAND\" },\n            { type: \"RELEASE_SEAT\" }\n        ];\n        if (floor !== 0) appendTravel(actions, floor, 0);\n        appendExitBuilding(actions);\n        return actions;\n    }\n\n    function planGoToLunch(agent) {\n        const actions = [\n            { type: \"STAND\" },\n            { type: \"RELEASE_SEAT\" }\n        ];\n        appendTravel(actions, agent.floor, 0);\n        const floorData = world.floors[0];\n        const seat = findFreeSeat(agent, 0, floorData.cafeSpots);\n        if (seat) {\n            actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: seat.wp });\n            actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"AT_LUNCH\" });\n            actions.push({ type: \"SIT\", floor: 0, wp: seat.wp });\n            actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: agent.lunchDuration });\n            actions.push({ type: \"STAND\" });\n            actions.push({ type: \"RELEASE_SEAT\", seatKey: seat.key });\n        } else {\n            actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: \"cafe_order\" });\n            actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"AT_LUNCH\" });\n            actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: agent.lunchDuration });\n        }\n        actions.push({ type: \"MARK_LUNCHED\" });\n        appendTravel(actions, 0, agent.homeFloor);\n        actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: agent.homeFloor, wp: agent.deskDoorWpName });\n        actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: agent.homeFloor, wp: agent.deskWpName });\n        actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"AT_DESK\" });\n        actions.push({ type: \"SIT\", floor: agent.homeFloor, wp: agent.deskWpName });\n        actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(20, 45) });\n        actions.push({ type: \"PICK_NEXT_ACTIVITY\" });\n        return actions;\n    }\n\n    function planVisitLounge(agent) {\n        const floor = agent.floor;\n        const floorData = world.floors[floor];\n        const seat = findFreeSeat(agent, floor, floorData.loungeSpots);\n        const actions = [\n            { type: \"STAND\" },\n            { type: \"RELEASE_SEAT\" }\n        ];\n        if (seat) {\n            actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: floor, wp: seat.wp });\n            actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"AT_BREAK\" });\n            actions.push({ type: \"SIT\", floor: floor, wp: seat.wp });\n            actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(5, 12) });\n            actions.push({ type: \"STAND\" });\n            actions.push({ type: \"RELEASE_SEAT\", seatKey: seat.key });\n        } else {\n            actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: floor, wp: \"water_cooler\" });\n            actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"AT_BREAK\" });\n            actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(5, 12) });\n        }\n        actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: floor, wp: agent.deskDoorWpName });\n        actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: floor, wp: agent.deskWpName });\n        actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"AT_DESK\" });\n        actions.push({ type: \"SIT\", floor: floor, wp: agent.deskWpName });\n        actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(15, 40) });\n        actions.push({ type: \"PICK_NEXT_ACTIVITY\" });\n        return actions;\n    }\n\n    function planAttendMeeting(agent) {\n        let targetFloor = agent.homeFloor;\n        if (Math.random() >= 0.65) targetFloor = randInt(1, WORLD.FLOOR_COUNT - 1);\n        const floorData = world.floors[targetFloor];\n        const seat = findFreeSeat(agent, targetFloor, floorData.confSeats);\n        if (!seat) return planVisitLounge(agent);\n\n        const actions = [\n            { type: \"STAND\" },\n            { type: \"RELEASE_SEAT\" }\n        ];\n        appendTravel(actions, agent.floor, targetFloor);\n        actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: targetFloor, wp: \"conf_center\" });\n        actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: targetFloor, wp: seat.wp });\n        actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"IN_MEETING\" });\n        actions.push({ type: \"SIT\", floor: targetFloor, wp: seat.wp });\n        actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(22, 45) });\n        actions.push({ type: \"STAND\" });\n        actions.push({ type: \"RELEASE_SEAT\", seatKey: seat.key });\n        appendTravel(actions, targetFloor, agent.homeFloor);\n        actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: agent.homeFloor, wp: agent.deskDoorWpName });\n        actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: agent.homeFloor, wp: agent.deskWpName });\n        actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"AT_DESK\" });\n        actions.push({ type: \"SIT\", floor: agent.homeFloor, wp: agent.deskWpName });\n        actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(20, 50) });\n        actions.push({ type: \"PICK_NEXT_ACTIVITY\" });\n        return actions;\n    }\n\n    function planVisitCoworker(agent) {\n        const candidates = [];\n        for (let i = 0; i < agents.length; i += 1) {\n            const other = agents[i];\n            if (other.id === agent.id) continue;\n            if (other.role === \"WORKER\" && other.state === \"AT_DESK\") candidates.push(other);\n        }\n        if (!candidates.length) return planWorkAtDesk(agent);\n        const coworker = randomChoice(candidates);\n        const targetFloor = coworker.homeFloor;\n        const actions = [\n            { type: \"STAND\" },\n            { type: \"RELEASE_SEAT\" }\n        ];\n        appendTravel(actions, agent.floor, targetFloor);\n        actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: targetFloor, wp: coworker.deskDoorWpName });\n        actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"VISITING\" });\n        actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(6, 18) });\n        appendTravel(actions, targetFloor, agent.homeFloor);\n        actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: agent.homeFloor, wp: agent.deskDoorWpName });\n        actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: agent.homeFloor, wp: agent.deskWpName });\n        actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"AT_DESK\" });\n        actions.push({ type: \"SIT\", floor: agent.homeFloor, wp: agent.deskWpName });\n        actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(20, 45) });\n        actions.push({ type: \"PICK_NEXT_ACTIVITY\" });\n        return actions;\n    }\n\n    function planWorkAtDesk(agent) {\n        const actions = [];\n        if (agent.floor !== agent.homeFloor) appendTravel(actions, agent.floor, agent.homeFloor);\n        actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: agent.homeFloor, wp: agent.deskDoorWpName });\n        actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: agent.homeFloor, wp: agent.deskWpName });\n        actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"AT_DESK\" });\n        actions.push({ type: \"SIT\", floor: agent.homeFloor, wp: agent.deskWpName });\n        actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(18, 65) });\n        actions.push({ type: \"PICK_NEXT_ACTIVITY\" });\n        return actions;\n    }\n\n    function planVisitorVisit(agent) {\n        const actions = [\n            { type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: \"outside\" },\n            { type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: \"front_door_threshold\" },\n            { type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: \"entrance\" },\n            { type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: \"lobby_center\" }\n        ];\n        const lobby = world.floors[0];\n        const roll = Math.random();\n        let upperFloor = 0;\n\n        if (roll < 0.10) {\n            const seat = findFreeSeat(agent, 0, lobby.cafeSpots);\n            if (seat) {\n                actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: seat.wp });\n                actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"VISITING\" });\n                actions.push({ type: \"SIT\", floor: 0, wp: seat.wp });\n                actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(15, 35) });\n                actions.push({ type: \"STAND\" });\n                actions.push({ type: \"RELEASE_SEAT\", seatKey: seat.key });\n            } else {\n                actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: \"lobby_stand_center\" });\n                actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"VISITING\" });\n                actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(8, 18) });\n            }\n        } else if (roll < 0.16) {\n            actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: \"cafe_order\" });\n            actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"VISITING\" });\n            actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(5, 12) });\n        } else if (roll < 0.30) {\n            const seat = findFreeSeat(agent, 0, lobby.loungeSpots);\n            if (seat) {\n                actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: seat.wp });\n                actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"VISITING\" });\n                actions.push({ type: \"SIT\", floor: 0, wp: seat.wp });\n                actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(12, 30) });\n                actions.push({ type: \"STAND\" });\n                actions.push({ type: \"RELEASE_SEAT\", seatKey: seat.key });\n            } else {\n                actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: \"lobby_stand_NE\" });\n                actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"VISITING\" });\n                actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(8, 18) });\n            }\n        } else if (roll < 0.42) {\n            const seat = findFreeSeat(agent, 0, lobby.backSpots);\n            if (seat) {\n                actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: seat.wp });\n                actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"VISITING\" });\n                actions.push({ type: \"SIT\", floor: 0, wp: seat.wp });\n                actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(12, 30) });\n                actions.push({ type: \"STAND\" });\n                actions.push({ type: \"RELEASE_SEAT\", seatKey: seat.key });\n            } else {\n                actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: \"pit_N\" });\n                actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"VISITING\" });\n                actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(8, 18) });\n            }\n        } else if (roll < 0.52) {\n            const spot = randomChoice(lobby.standSpots) || \"reception\";\n            actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: spot });\n            actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"VISITING\" });\n            actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(5, 15) });\n        } else if (roll < 0.62) {\n            const spot = randomChoice(lobby.loiterSpots) || \"lobby_stand_center\";\n            actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: spot });\n            actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"VISITING\" });\n            actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(8, 20) });\n        } else if (roll < 0.77) {\n            upperFloor = randInt(1, WORLD.FLOOR_COUNT - 1);\n            const upper = world.floors[upperFloor];\n            const seat = findFreeSeat(agent, upperFloor, upper.loungeSpots);\n            appendTravel(actions, 0, upperFloor);\n            if (seat) {\n                actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: upperFloor, wp: seat.wp });\n                actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"AT_BREAK\" });\n                actions.push({ type: \"SIT\", floor: upperFloor, wp: seat.wp });\n                actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(10, 25) });\n                actions.push({ type: \"STAND\" });\n                actions.push({ type: \"RELEASE_SEAT\", seatKey: seat.key });\n            } else {\n                actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: upperFloor, wp: \"water_cooler\" });\n                actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"AT_BREAK\" });\n                actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(8, 18) });\n            }\n            appendTravel(actions, upperFloor, 0);\n        } else {\n            upperFloor = randInt(1, WORLD.FLOOR_COUNT - 1);\n            const upper = world.floors[upperFloor];\n            const seat = findFreeSeat(agent, upperFloor, upper.confSeats);\n            if (!seat) {\n                const spot = randomChoice(lobby.loiterSpots) || \"lobby_stand_center\";\n                actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: 0, wp: spot });\n                actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"VISITING\" });\n                actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(8, 20) });\n            } else {\n                appendTravel(actions, 0, upperFloor);\n                actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: upperFloor, wp: \"conf_center\" });\n                actions.push({ type: \"WALK_TO_WP\", floor: upperFloor, wp: seat.wp });\n                actions.push({ type: \"ENTER_STATE\", state: \"IN_MEETING\" });\n                actions.push({ type: \"SIT\", floor: upperFloor, wp: seat.wp });\n                actions.push({ type: \"WAIT_SIM\", minutes: randInt(20, 40) });\n                actions.push({ type: \"STAND\" });\n                actions.push({ type: \"RELEASE_SEAT\", seatKey: seat.key });\n                appendTravel(actions, upperFloor, 0);\n            }\n        }\n\n        void upperFloor;\n        appendExitBuilding(actions);\n        return actions;\n    }\n\n    function chooseNextActivity(agent) {\n        if (agent.role === \"VISITOR\") {\n            agent.plan = planVisitorVisit(agent);\n            return;\n        }\n        const now = simClock.simMinute;\n        if (now >= agent.departureTime) {\n            agent.plan = planLeaveBuilding(agent);\n            return;\n        }\n\n        const remainingMeetings = [];\n        let meetingDue = false;\n        for (let i = 0; i < agent.plannedMeetingTimes.length; i += 1) {\n            const meetingTime = agent.plannedMeetingTimes[i];\n            if (now >= meetingTime && now - meetingTime < 120) {\n                meetingDue = true;\n            } else if (now < meetingTime) {\n                remainingMeetings.push(meetingTime);\n            }\n        }\n        agent.plannedMeetingTimes = remainingMeetings;\n        if (meetingDue) {\n            agent.plan = planAttendMeeting(agent);\n            return;\n        }\n\n        if (!agent.hasLunched && now >= agent.lunchTime && now < 15 * 60) {\n            agent.plan = planGoToLunch(agent);\n            return;\n        }\n\n        const roll = Math.random();\n        if (roll < 0.14) {\n            agent.plan = planAttendMeeting(agent);\n        } else if (roll < 0.26) {\n            agent.plan = planVisitLounge(agent);\n        } else if (roll < 0.41) {\n            agent.plan = planVisitCoworker(agent);\n        } else {\n            agent.plan = planWorkAtDesk(agent);\n        }\n    }\n\n    function maybeDepart(agent) {\n        if (agent.role !== \"WORKER\" || agent.leaving) return;\n        if (simClock.simMinute < agent.departureTime) return;\n        if (agent.state === \"GONE\" || agent.state === \"AWAY\" || agent.state === \"DISABLED\") return;\n        if (agent.state === \"IN_CAR\" || agent.state === \"WAITING_ELEVATOR\") return;\n        const action = agent.currentAction;\n        if (action && (action.type === \"WAIT_AT_PANEL\" || action.type === \"ENTER_ELEVATOR\" ||\n            action.type === \"PRESS_FLOOR\" || action.type === \"WAIT_FOR_FLOOR\" ||\n            action.type === \"EXIT_ELEVATOR\")) {\n            return;\n        }\n        releaseAgentSeats(agent);\n        agent.plan = planLeaveBuilding(agent);\n        agent.currentAction = null;\n    }\n\n    function isEntranceWaypoint(name) {\n        return ENTRANCE_WAYPOINTS.indexOf(name) !== -1;\n    }\n\n    function buildWalkPath(agent, floor, wpName) {\n        const floorData = world.floors[floor];\n        if (!floorData) {\n            agent.path = [];\n            agent.pathIndex = 0;\n            return;\n        }\n        const targetNode = floorData.nodes[wpName];\n        if (!targetNode) {\n            agent.path = [];\n            agent.pathIndex = 0;\n            return;\n        }\n        const startName = world.nearestNode(floorData.nodes, agent.group.position);\n        let path = world.bfsPath(floorData.nodes, startName, wpName);\n        if (!path.length) path = [targetNode.pos.clone()];\n        agent.path = path;\n        agent.pathIndex = 0;\n        if (path.length > 1 && path[0].distanceTo(agent.group.position) < 0.55) {\n            agent.pathIndex = 1;\n        }\n        agent._prevPos = agent.group.position.clone();\n        agent._stallT = 0;\n    }\n\n    function walkAlongPath(agent, dt) {\n        if (!agent.path || agent.pathIndex >= agent.path.length) return true;\n        let budget = AGENT_WALK_SPEED * dt;\n        let guard = 0;\n        while (budget > 0 && agent.pathIndex < agent.path.length && guard < 40) {\n            guard += 1;\n            const target = agent.path[agent.pathIndex];\n            const pos = agent.group.position;\n            const dx = target.x - pos.x;\n            const dz = target.z - pos.z;\n            const dist = Math.sqrt(dx * dx + dz * dz);\n            if (dist < 0.12) {\n                agent.pathIndex += 1;\n                continue;\n            }\n            const step = Math.min(dist, budget);\n            pos.x += dx / dist * step;\n            pos.z += dz / dist * step;\n            pos.y = agent.floor * WORLD.FLOOR_HEIGHT;\n            agent.group.rotation.y = Math.atan2(dx, dz);\n            budget -= step;\n        }\n        if (agent.pathIndex >= agent.path.length) return true;\n\n        const prev = agent._prevPos || agent.group.position.clone();\n        const moved = agent.group.position.distanceTo(prev);\n        if (moved < 0.005) {\n            agent._stallT = (agent._stallT || 0) + dt;\n            if (agent._stallT > 1.2) {\n                agent.pathIndex += 1;\n                agent._stallT = 0;\n                const action = agent.currentAction;\n                if (action && action.type === \"WALK_TO_WP\" && isEntranceWaypoint(action.wp) &&\n                    agent.pathIndex < agent.path.length) {\n                    const next = agent.path[agent.pathIndex];\n                    agent.group.position.x = next.x;\n                    agent.group.position.z = next.z;\n                }\n            }\n        } else {\n            agent._stallT = 0;\n        }\n        agent._prevPos = agent.group.position.clone();\n        return false;\n    }\n\n    function startAction(agent, action) {\n        if (action.type === \"WALK_TO_WP\") {\n            buildWalkPath(agent, action.floor, action.wp);\n            agent.state = agent.state === \"AT_DESK\" ? \"ON_FLOOR\" : agent.state;\n            if (agent.state === \"AT_DESK\" || agent.state === \"IN_MEETING\" ||\n                agent.state === \"AT_BREAK\" || agent.state === \"AT_LUNCH\" ||\n                agent.state === \"VISITING\") {\n                agent.state = \"ON_FLOOR\";\n            }\n        } else if (action.type === \"WAIT_AT_PANEL\") {\n            agent.state = \"WAITING_ELEVATOR\";\n            action.dir = action.toFloor > action.floor ? 1 : -1;\n            if (action.dir > 0) elevator.callUp(action.floor);\n            else elevator.callDown(action.floor);\n        } else if (action.type === \"ENTER_ELEVATOR\") {\n            action.phase = \"reserve\";\n            action.spot = null;\n            action._stallT = 0;\n        } else if (action.type === \"EXIT_ELEVATOR\") {\n            elevator.registerDisembark(agent);\n            scene.attach(agent.group);\n            agent.floor = action.toFloor;\n            agent.group.position.y = agent.floor * WORLD.FLOOR_HEIGHT;\n            agent.state = \"ON_FLOOR\";\n            action._exitTarget = world.floors[action.toFloor].nodes.elevWait.pos.clone();\n            action._prevPos = agent.group.position.clone();\n            action._stallT = 0;\n        } else if (action.type === \"SIT\") {\n            const floorData = world.floors[action.floor];\n            const node = floorData.nodes[action.wp];\n            const target = floorData.sitTargets[action.wp] || { sit: false, facing: 0 };\n            if (node) {\n                let x = node.pos.x;\n                let z = node.pos.z;\n                if (!target.sit) {\n                    const angle = Math.random() * Math.PI * 2;\n                    const radius = 0.35 + Math.random() * 0.4;\n                    x += Math.cos(angle) * radius;\n                    z += Math.sin(angle) * radius;\n                }\n                agent.floor = action.floor;\n                agent.group.position.set(x, action.floor * WORLD.FLOOR_HEIGHT, z);\n                agent.group.rotation.y = target.facing;\n                agent.group.userData.isSitting = Boolean(target.sit);\n                agent.group.userData.isWalking = false;\n                if (target.sit) agent.group.position.y = action.floor * WORLD.FLOOR_HEIGHT - 0.35;\n            }\n        } else if (action.type === \"STAND\") {\n            agent.group.userData.isSitting = false;\n            agent.group.userData.isWalking = false;\n            if (agent.group.parent === elevator.carGroup) {\n                agent.group.position.y = 0;\n            } else {\n                agent.group.position.y = agent.floor * WORLD.FLOOR_HEIGHT;\n            }\n        } else if (action.type === \"RELEASE_SEAT\") {\n            if (action.seatKey) releaseSeatKey(agent, action.seatKey);\n            else releaseAgentSeats(agent);\n        } else if (action.type === \"WAIT_SIM\") {\n            action.untilMin = simClock.simMinute + (action.minutes || 0);\n        } else if (action.type === \"EXIT_BUILDING\") {\n            releaseAgentSeats(agent);\n            if (agent.group.parent) agent.group.parent.remove(agent.group);\n            agent.group.visible = false;\n            agent.state = \"GONE\";\n            agent.leaving = false;\n        } else if (action.type === \"PRESS_