FLOOR even if currently IN_CAR? Shouldn't walk while in car. Fine.\nPotential issue: WAIT_AT_PANEL agent may be far from panel but state waiting; okay.\nPotential issue: agents queued waiting at floor0 but topup new visitors arrive and walk to elevWait, maybe collision exempt only entrance. Waiting crowd can bunch but collision separates. Fine.\n\nNeed check elevator logic door behavior with leftover calls. Observed at 8:37 elevator floor2 DOOR_OPEN riders3 Dest[3,4], Up[0], Down[1,3]. It seems okay. But Up[0] persistent; car goes up to 4 then down. Good.\n\nNeed maybe test day wrap reset and no errors. Run probe at 600x for longer (e.g. 30s real = 5h sim? At 600x, 30s = 300 min =5h; start 7:30 ->12:30; to see lunch. 60s -> 10h ->17:30; 90s -> full day+ wrap). Could run 60s and inspect no errors and states. Also maybe day wrap with 120s. Let's do a probe at 600x occupancy 60, wait 60s, sample HUD every 10s, check no errors and day wrap. Also maybe inspect if agents get stuck. Use 600 speed slider max. We can set occupancy 60. Let's run 90s maybe."}}
