xempt. But if doors open, step out. Requirement reparent preserving world pos and walk to elevWait; completeDisembark. Do:\\n- start: elevator.registerDisembark(agent); scene.attach(group); group.position.y = floor*FH; agent.floor=floor; agent.state='ON_FLOOR'; set path direct to elevWait? Actually position inside car z~±0.6. Need move out to z=3.8. Use direct target. Each frame move; when close, completeDisembark(agent); complete action. registerDisembark holds doors while exiting. If we completeDisembark after reaching elevWait, doors held long enough. Collision exemption for EXIT_ELEVATOR.\\n\\nBut scene.attach then position y=floor*FH resets to car floor same. Good. However car may move immediately after doors close while agent still exiting; pendingDisembark holds doors until complete. Good.\\n\\nSIT(floor,wp): on start find target world pos (node pos). Snap x,z, set y=floor*FH - 0.35. apply rotation.y=facing. isSitting=true. state maybe set by ENTER_STATE before. Reserve seat at plan compile. For standing target jitter. For sit target maybe snap exactly. Note node position is seat center. Set group y. Complete immediately.\\nSTAND: isSitting=false; y = agent.floor*FH (or if in car? car local y 0; agent.floor? use parent car). We set group.position.y=0 if parent is car else floor*FH. state maybe.\\nRELEASE_SEAT: release action.seatKey or agent's; complete.\\n\\nWAIT_SIM: start sets untilMin = simClock.simMinute + minutes. If minutes undefined maybe use random. Wait until simMinute >= untilMin. Complete. At high timescale fine.\\nEXIT_BUILDING: remove group from scene, state GONE, visible false, complete plan done. For workers GONE until next day; visitors top-up re-arms. Also release seats.\\n\\nENTER_STATE(state): set agent.state; complete.\\nMARK_LUNCHED: hasLunched=true; complete.\\nPICK_NEXT_ACTIVITY: call chooseNextActivity(agent), which sets plan. Complete current. The dispatch loop then continues. Need avoid infinite if plan empty. choose always sets.\\n