er spot and walk there after already lobby_center. Good.\\nNeed choose free conf seat helper:\\n```\\nfunction pickFreeSeat(agent, floor, list) { shuffle? iterate random start }\\n```\\nImplement `findFreeSeat(agent, floor, names)` loops shuffled order. Reserve. Return {wp,key} or null.\\nFor lounge etc.\\n\\n`randomChoice` uses Math.random.\\n\\n`randInt(min,max)` inclusive.\\n\\n`seatKey` helper.\\n\\nReservation release:\\n```\\nfunction releaseSeatKey(agent,key){ if(!key)return; seatReservations.delete(key); const idx=agent.reservedSeats.indexOf(key); if(idx>=0) agent.reservedSeats.splice(idx,1);}\\nfunction releaseAgentSeats(agent){ agent.reservedSeats.slice().forEach(function(key){seatReservations.delete(key)}); agent.reservedSeats=[];}\\n```\\n\\nAction seatKey stored in RELEASE_SEAT action for explicit. For meeting plan set release action `{type:'RELEASE_SEAT', seatKey:key}`. For lounge etc.\\n\\nNeed SIT action maybe seatKey? not necessary.\\n\\n`findFreeSeat` reserves at compile. If plan later aborted, releaseAgentSeats.\\n\\nPotential issue workers planAttendMeeting fallback planVisitLounge calls reserve seat. fine.\\n\\n`planWorkAtDesk`:\\n```\\nfunction planWorkAtDesk(agent){\\n if(agent.floor===agent.homeFloor && agent.state==='AT_DESK') return [{WAIT_SIM minutes},PICK];\\n const actions=[];\\n if(agent.floor!==agent.homeFloor){ actions.push({WALK_TO_WP floor elevWait}); appendTravel(...); }\\n actions.push({WALK deskDoor},{WALK desk},{ENTER_STATE AT_DESK},{SIT desk},{WAIT_SIM},{PICK});\\n return actions;\\n}\\n```\\nBut if at desk sitting, WAIT. If at desk but standing maybe still. Fine.\\nNeed if agent in meeting and choose? no.\\n\\n`planVisitCoworker` fallback planWorkAtDesk maybe if no candidate.\\n\\n`planReturnToDesk` not separate.\\n\\nNow chooseNextActivity meeting times: `plannedMeetingTimes` sorted. Use findIndex. If now >= time and now-time<120. If meeting time much earlier due high timescale, still attend if within 120 sim minutes. Else dr